#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:4
msgid "The Graphical User Interface"
msgstr "Grafički korisnički interfejs"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Graphical User Interface *(GUI)* provides access to all library "
"management and e-book format conversion features. The basic workflow for "
"using calibre is to first add books to the library from your hard disk. "
"calibre will automatically try to read metadata from the books and add them "
"to its internal database. Once they are in the database, you can perform "
"various :ref:`actions` on them that include conversion from one format to "
"another, transfer to the reading device, viewing on your computer, and "
"editing metadata. The latter includes modifying the cover, description, and "
"tags among other details. Note that calibre creates copies of the files you "
"add to it. Your original files are left untouched."
msgstr "Grafički korisnički interfejs *(GUI)* pruža pristup svim funkcijama za upravljanje bibliotekom i konverziju formata e-knjiga. Osnovni tok rada za korišćenje calibre-a je da prvo dodate knjige u biblioteku sa vašeg čvrstog diska. calibre će automatski pokušati da pročita metapodatke iz knjiga i doda ih u svoju internu bazu podataka. Kada se nađu u bazi podataka, možete obavljati razne :ref:`actions` nad njima, što uključuje konverziju iz jednog formata u drugi, prenos na uređaj za čitanje, pregled na vašem računaru i uređivanje metapodataka. Ovo poslednje uključuje menjanje korica, opisa i oznaka, između ostalih detalja. Imajte na umu da calibre kreira kopije datoteka koje mu dodate. Vaše originalne datoteke ostaju netaknute."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:16
msgid "The interface is divided into various sections:"
msgstr "Interfejs je podeljen na različite sekcije:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:25
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Akcije"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:27
msgid "The Actions Toolbar"
msgstr "Traka sa alatkama za akcije"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:31
msgid ""
"The actions toolbar provides convenient shortcuts to commonly used actions. "
"If you right-click the buttons, you can perform variations on the default "
"action. Please note that the actions toolbar will look slightly different "
"depending on whether you have an e-book reader attached to your computer."
msgstr "Traka sa alatkama za akcije pruža praktične prečice do često korišćenih akcija. Ako kliknete desnim tasterom miša na dugmad, možete izvršiti varijacije podrazumevane akcije. Imajte na umu da će traka sa alatkama za akcije izgledati malo drugačije u zavisnosti od toga da li imate čitač e-knjiga priključen na vaš računar."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:41
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:916
msgid "Add books"
msgstr "Dodaj knjige"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:45
msgid ""
"|adbi| The :guilabel:`Add books` action has many variations accessed by "
"doing a right-click on the button."
msgstr "|adbi| Akcija :guilabel:`Dodaj knjige` ima mnogo varijacija kojima se pristupa desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:42
msgid "adbi"
msgstr "adbi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Add books from a single folder**: Opens a file chooser dialog and allows "
"you to specify which books in a folder should be added. This action is "
"*context sensitive*, i.e. it depends on which :ref:`catalog <catalogs>` you "
"have selected. If you have selected the :guilabel:`Library`, books will be "
"added to the library. If you have selected the e-book reader device, the "
"books will be uploaded to the device, and so on."
msgstr "**Dodaj knjige iz jedne fascikle**: Otvara dijalog za izbor datoteka i omogućava vam da odredite koje knjige u fascikli treba dodati. Ova akcija je *zavisna od konteksta*, tj. zavisi od toga koji :ref:`catalog <catalogs>` ste izabrali. Ako ste izabrali :guilabel:`Biblioteka`, knjige će biti dodate u biblioteku. Ako ste izabrali uređaj za čitanje e-knjiga, knjige će biti otpremljene na uređaj, i tako dalje."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Add books from folders and sub-folders**: Allows you to choose a folder. "
"The folder and all its sub-folders are scanned recursively, and any e-books "
"found are added to the library. You can choose whether to have calibre add "
"all files present in a single folder to a single book record or multiple "
"book records. calibre assumes that each folder contains a single book. All "
"e-book files in a folder are assumed to be the same book in different "
"formats. This action is the inverse of the :ref:`Save to disk "
"<save_to_disk_multiple>` action, i.e. you can :guilabel:`Save to disk`, "
"delete the books and re-add them in single book per folder mode, with no "
"lost information except for the date (this assumes you have not changed any "
"of the settings for the Save to disk action)."
msgstr "**Dodaj knjige iz fascikli i podfascikli**: Omogućava vam da izaberete fasciklu. Fascikla i sve njene podfascikle se rekurzivno skeniraju, a sve pronađene e-knjige se dodaju u biblioteku. Možete izabrati da li će calibre dodati sve datoteke prisutne u jednoj fascikli u jedan zapis o knjizi ili u više zapisa o knjigama. calibre pretpostavlja da svaka fascikla sadrži jednu knjigu. Pretpostavlja se da su sve datoteke e-knjiga u fascikli ista knjiga u različitim formatima. Ova akcija je obrnuta od akcije :ref:`Sačuvaj na disk <save_to_disk_multiple>`, tj. možete :guilabel:`Sačuvaj na disku`, izbrisati knjige i ponovo ih dodati u režimu jedna knjiga po fascikli, bez izgubljenih informacija osim datuma (ovo pretpostavlja da niste promenili nijedno od podešavanja za akciju Sačuvaj na disk)."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Add multiple books from archive (ZIP/RAR/7z)**: Allows you to add multiple"
" e-books that are stored inside the selected archive files. It is a "
"convenient shortcut that avoids having to first unzip the archive and then "
"add the books via add books from folders."
msgstr "**Dodaj više knjiga iz arhive (ZIP/RAR/7z)**: Omogućava vam da dodate više e-knjiga koje su sačuvane unutar izabranih arhivskih datoteka. To je zgodna prečica koja izbegava potrebu da prvo raspakujete arhivu, a zatim dodate knjige preko dodavanja knjiga iz fascikli."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Add empty book (Book Entry with no formats)**: Allows you to create a "
"blank book record. This can be used to then manually fill out the "
"information about a book that you may not have yet in your collection."
msgstr "**Dodaj praznu knjigu (Zapis o knjizi bez formata)**: Omogućava vam da kreirate prazan zapis o knjizi. Ovo se može koristiti za ručno popunjavanje informacija o knjizi koju možda još nemate u svojoj kolekciji."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Add from ISBN**: Allows you to add one or more books by entering their "
"ISBNs."
msgstr "**Dodaj iz ISBN-a**: Omogućava vam da dodate jednu ili više knjiga unosom njihovih ISBN-ova."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Add files to selected book records**: Allows you to add or update the "
"files associated with an existing book in your library."
msgstr "**Dodaj datoteke u izabrane zapise o knjigama**: Omogućava vam da dodate ili ažurirate datoteke povezane sa postojećom knjigom u vašoj biblioteci."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Add files to selected book records from clipboard**: Allows you to add or "
"update the files associated with an existing book in your library from the "
"current contents of the clipboard"
msgstr "**Dodaj datoteke u izabrane zapise o knjigama iz ostave**: Omogućava vam da dodate ili ažurirate datoteke povezane sa postojećom knjigom u vašoj biblioteci iz trenutnog sadržaja ostave"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Add data files to selected book records**: Allows you to add any number of"
" extra files that will be stored in a :file:`data` sub-directory in the book"
" directory. See :ref:`data_files` for details."
msgstr "**Dodaj datoteke sa podacima u izabrane zapise o knjigama**: Omogućava vam da dodate bilo koji broj dodatnih datoteka koje će biti sačuvane u :file:`data` poddirektorijumu u direktorijumu knjige. Pogledajte :ref:`data_files` za detalje."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Add an empty file to selected book records**: Allows you to add an empty "
"file of the specified format to the selected book records."
msgstr "**Dodaj praznu datoteku u izabrane zapise o knjigama**: Omogućava vam da dodate praznu datoteku navedenog formata u izabrane zapise o knjigama."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:66
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Add books` action can read metadata from a wide variety of "
"e-book formats. In addition, it tries to guess metadata from the filename. "
"See the :ref:`config_filename_metadata` section, to learn how to configure "
"this."
msgstr "Akcija :guilabel:`Dodaj knjige` može da čita metapodatke iz različitih formata e-knjiga. Pored toga, pokušava da izvede metapodatke iz imena fajla. Pogledajte odeljak :ref:`config_filename_metadata` da biste naučili kako se to podešava."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:69
msgid ""
"To add an additional format for an existing book you can do any of three "
"things:"
msgstr "Da biste dodali dodatni format za postojeću knjigu, možete uraditi bilo koju od tri stvari:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:71
msgid ""
"Drag and drop the file onto the Book details panel on the right side of the "
"main window"
msgstr "Prevući i pustiti fajl na panel Detalji o knjizi na desnoj strani glavnog prozora"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:73
msgid ""
"Right click the :guilabel:`Add books` button and choose :guilabel:`Add files"
" to selected books`."
msgstr "Kliknuti desnim tasterom miša na dugme :guilabel:`Dodaj knjige` i izabrati :guilabel:`Dodaj fajlove izabranim knjigama`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:75
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Add books` button in the top right area of the "
":guilabel:`Edit metadata` dialog, accessed by the "
":ref:`edit_meta_information` action."
msgstr "Kliknuti na dugme :guilabel:`Dodaj knjige` u gornjem desnom delu dijaloga :guilabel:`Uredi metapodatke`, kojem se pristupa akcijom :ref:`edit_meta_information`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:80
msgid "Edit metadata"
msgstr "Uredi metapodatke"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:84
msgid ""
"|emii| The :guilabel:`Edit metadata` action has many variations which can be"
" accessed by doing a right-click on the button."
msgstr "|emii| Akcija :guilabel:`Uredi metapodatke` ima mnogo varijacija kojima se može pristupiti desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:81
msgid "emii"
msgstr "emii"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:86
msgid ""
"**Edit metadata individually**: Allows you to edit the metadata of books "
"one-by-one with the option of fetching metadata, including covers, from the "
"Internet. It also allows you to add or remove particular e-book formats from"
" a book."
msgstr "**Uredi metapodatke pojedinačno**: Omogućava vam da uređujete metapodatke knjiga jednu po jednu sa opcijom preuzimanja metapodataka, uključujući korice, sa interneta. Takođe vam omogućava da dodate ili uklonite određene formate e-knjiga iz knjige."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:87
msgid ""
"**Edit metadata in bulk**: Allows you to edit common metadata fields for "
"large numbers of books simultaneously. It operates on all the books you have"
" selected in the :ref:`Library view <search_sort>`."
msgstr "**Grupno uređivanje metapodataka**: Omogućava vam da istovremeno uređujete uobičajena polja metapodataka za veliki broj knjiga. Primenjuje se na sve knjige koje ste izabrali u :ref:`Prikazu biblioteke <search_sort>`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Download metadata and covers**: Downloads metadata and covers (if "
"available) for the books that are selected in the book list."
msgstr "**Preuzimanje metapodataka i korica**: Preuzima metapodatke i korice (ako su dostupni) za knjige koje su izabrane na listi knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:89
msgid ""
"**Copy metadata**: Copy metadata for the current book onto the system "
"clipboard"
msgstr "**Kopiraj metapodatke**: Kopira metapodatke za trenutnu knjigu u sistemsku ostavu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:90
msgid ""
"**Paste metadata**: Paste metadata from the system clipboard onto the "
"currently selected books"
msgstr "**Nalepi metapodatke**: Nalepi metapodatke iz sistemske ostave na trenutno izabrane knjige"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:91
msgid ""
"**Merge book records**: Gives you the capability of merging the metadata and"
" formats of two or more book records. You can choose to either delete or "
"keep the records that were not clicked first."
msgstr "**Spoji zapise o knjigama**: Daje vam mogućnost spajanja metapodataka i formata dva ili više zapisa o knjigama. Možete izabrati da obrišete ili zadržite zapise na koje niste prvo kliknuli."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Manage data files**: Manage the extra data files associated with the "
"selected books."
msgstr "**Upravljanje datotekama sa podacima**: Upravljajte dodatnim datotekama sa podacima povezanim sa izabranim knjigama."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:94
msgid "For more details, see :ref:`metadata`."
msgstr "Za više detalja, pogledajte :ref:`metadata`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:99
msgid "Convert books"
msgstr "Pretvaranje knjige"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:103
msgid ""
"|cei| E-books can be converted from a number of formats into whatever format"
" your e-book reader prefers. Many e-books available for purchase will be "
"protected by :doc:`Digital Rights Management <drm>` *(DRM)* technology. "
"calibre will not convert these e-books. It is easy to remove the DRM from "
"many formats, but as this may be illegal, you will have to find tools to "
"liberate your books yourself and then use calibre to convert them."
msgstr "|cei| E-knjige se mogu konvertovati iz brojnih formata u format koji vaš čitač e-knjiga preferira. Mnoge e-knjige dostupne za kupovinu biće zaštićene :doc:`Digital Rights Management <drm>` *(DRM)* tehnologijom. calibre neće konvertovati ove e-knjige. Lako je ukloniti DRM iz mnogih formata, ali pošto to može biti nelegalno, moraćete sami da pronađete alate za oslobađanje vaših knjiga i zatim koristite calibre da ih konvertujete."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:100
msgid "cei"
msgstr "cei"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:108
msgid ""
"For most people, conversion should be a simple one-click affair. If you want"
" to learn more about the conversion process, see :ref:`conversion`."
msgstr "Za većinu ljudi, konverzija bi trebalo da bude jednostavna stvar na jedan klik. Ako želite da saznate više o procesu konverzije, pogledajte :ref:`conversion`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:110
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Convert books` action has three variations, accessed by doing"
" a right-click on the button."
msgstr "Akcija :guilabel:`Pretvaranje knjige` ima tri varijacije, kojima se pristupa desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:112
msgid ""
"**Convert individually**: Allows you to specify conversion options to "
"customize the conversion of each selected e-book."
msgstr "**Pretvori pojedinačno**: Omogućava vam da odredite opcije konverzije kako biste prilagodili konverziju svake izabrane e-knjige."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Bulk convert**: Allows you to specify options only once to convert a "
"number of e-books in bulk."
msgstr "**Grupno pretvori**: Omogućava vam da odredite opcije samo jednom za masovnu konverziju više e-knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:116
msgid ""
"**Create a catalog of the books in your calibre library**: Allows you to "
"generate a complete listing of the books in your library, including all "
"metadata, in several formats such as XML, CSV, BiBTeX, EPUB and MOBI. The "
"catalog will contain all the books currently showing in the library view. "
"This allows you to use the search features to limit the books to be "
"catalogued. In addition, if you select multiple books using the mouse, only "
"those books will be added to the catalog. If you generate the catalog in an "
"e-book format such as EPUB, MOBI or AZW3, the next time you connect your "
"e-book reader the catalog will be automatically sent to the device. For more"
" information on how catalogs work, read the :ref:`catalog_tut`."
msgstr "**Napravi katalog knjiga iz calibre biblioteke**: Omogućava vam da generišete kompletan spisak knjiga u vašoj biblioteci, uključujući sve metapodatke, u nekoliko formata kao što su XML, CSV, BiBTeX, EPUB i MOBI. Katalog će sadržati sve knjige koje se trenutno prikazuju u pregledu biblioteke. Ovo vam omogućava da koristite funkcije pretrage da ograničite knjige koje će biti katalogizovane. Pored toga, ako izaberete više knjiga pomoću miša, samo te knjige će biti dodate u katalog. Ako generišete katalog u formatu e-knjige kao što su EPUB, MOBI ili AZW3, sledeći put kada povežete vaš čitač e-knjiga, katalog će automatski biti poslat na uređaj. Za više informacija o tome kako katalozi funkcionišu, pročitajte :ref:`catalog_tut`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:126
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:946
msgid "View"
msgstr "Prikaz"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:130
msgid ""
"|vi| The :guilabel:`View` action displays the book in an e-book viewer "
"program. calibre has a built-in viewer for many e-book formats. For other "
"formats it uses the default operating system application. You can configure "
"which formats should open with the internal viewer via "
":guilabel:`Preferences->Interface->Behavior`. If a book has more than one "
"format, you can view a particular format by doing a right-click on the "
"button."
msgstr "|vi| Akcija :guilabel:`Prikaz` prikazuje knjigu u programu za pregled e-knjiga. calibre ima ugrađen pregledač za mnoge formate e-knjiga. Za ostale formate koristi podrazumevanu aplikaciju operativnog sistema. Možete podesiti koji formati treba da se otvaraju sa internim pregledačem preko :guilabel:`Podešavanja → Interfejs → Ponašanje`. Ako knjiga ima više od jednog formata, možete pregledati određeni format desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:127
msgid "vi"
msgstr "vi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:141
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:922
msgid "Send to device"
msgstr "Pošalji na uređaj"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:145
msgid ""
"|stdi| The :guilabel:`Send to device` action has eight variations, accessed "
"by doing a right-click on the button."
msgstr "|stdi| Akcija :guilabel:`Pošalji na uređaj` ima osam varijacija, kojima se pristupa desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:142
msgid "stdi"
msgstr "stdi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:147
msgid ""
"**Send to main memory**: The selected books are transferred to the main "
"memory of the e-book reader."
msgstr "**Pošalji u glavnu memoriju**: Izabrane knjige se prebacuju u glavnu memoriju čitača e-knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:148
msgid ""
"**Send to card (A)**: The selected books are transferred to the storage card"
" (A) on the e-book reader."
msgstr "**Pošalji na karticu (A)**: Izabrane knjige se prebacuju na memorijsku karticu (A) na čitaču e-knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:149
msgid ""
"**Send to card (B)**: The selected books are transferred to the storage card"
" (B) on the e-book reader."
msgstr "**Pošalji na karticu (B)**: Izabrane knjige se prebacuju na memorijsku karticu (B) na čitaču e-knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:150
msgid ""
"**Send specific format to**: The selected books are transferred to the "
"selected storage location on the device, in the format that you specify."
msgstr "**Pošalji određeni format na**: Izabrane knjige se prebacuju na izabranu lokaciju za skladištenje na uređaju, u formatu koji navedete."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:151
msgid "**Eject device**: Detaches the device from calibre."
msgstr "**Izbaci uređaj**: Odvaja uređaj od calibre-a."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:152
msgid ""
"**Set default send to device action**: Allows you to specify which of the "
"options, 1 through 5 above or 7 below, will be the default action when you "
"click the main button."
msgstr "**Postavi podrazumevanu akciju slanja na uređaj**: Omogućava vam da odredite koja od opcija, od 1 do 5 iznad ili 7 ispod, će biti podrazumevana akcija kada kliknete na glavno dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:153
msgid ""
"**Send and delete from library**: The selected books are transferred to the "
"selected storage location on the device and then **deleted** from the "
"Library."
msgstr "**Pošalji i obriši iz biblioteke**: Izabrane knjige se prebacuju na izabranu lokaciju za skladištenje na uređaju, a zatim se **brišu** iz biblioteke."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:154
msgid ""
"**Fetch Annotations (experimental)**: Transfers annotations you may have "
"made on an e-book on your device to the comments metadata of the book in the"
" calibre library."
msgstr "**Preuzmi beleške (eksperimentalno)**: Prebacuje beleške koje ste možda napravili u e-knjizi na vašem uređaju u metapodatke komentara knjige u calibre biblioteci."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:156
msgid ""
"You can control the file name and folder structure of files sent to the "
"device by setting up a template in "
":guilabel:`Preferences->Import/export->Sending books to devices`. Also see "
":ref:`templatelangcalibre`."
msgstr "Možete kontrolisati ime datoteke i strukturu fascikli datoteka poslatih na uređaj postavljanjem šablona u :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Uvoz/izvoz->Slanje knjiga na uređaje`. Takođe pogledajte :ref:`templatelangcalibre`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:162
msgid "Fetch news"
msgstr "Preuzmi vesti"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:166
msgid ""
"|fni| The :guilabel:`Fetch news` action downloads news from various websites"
" and converts it into an e-book that can be read on your e-book reader. "
"Normally, the newly created e-book is added to your e-book library, but if "
"an e-book reader is connected at the time the download finishes, the news is"
" also uploaded to the reader automatically."
msgstr "|fni| Akcija :guilabel:`Preuzmi vesti` preuzima vesti sa raznih veb sajtova i konvertuje ih u e-knjigu koja se može čitati na vašem čitaču e-knjiga. Obično se novostvorena e-knjiga dodaje u vašu biblioteku e-knjiga, ali ako je čitač e-knjiga povezan u trenutku kada se preuzimanje završi, vesti se takođe automatski otpremaju na čitač."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:163
msgid "fni"
msgstr "fni"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:168
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Fetch news` action uses simple recipes (10-15 lines of code) "
"for each news site. To learn how to create recipes for your own news "
"sources, see :ref:`news`."
msgstr "Akcija :guilabel:`Preuzmi vesti` koristi jednostavne recepte (10-15 linija koda) za svaki sajt sa vestima. Da biste naučili kako da kreirate recepte za sopstvene izvore vesti, pogledajte :ref:`news`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:170
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Fetch news` action has three variations, accessed by doing a "
"right-click on the button."
msgstr "Akcija :guilabel:`Preuzmi vesti` ima tri varijacije, kojima se pristupa desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:172
msgid ""
"**Schedule news download**: Allows you to schedule the download of your "
"selected news sources from a list of hundreds available.  Scheduling can be "
"set individually for each news source you select and the scheduling is "
"flexible allowing you to select specific days of the week or a frequency of "
"days between downloads."
msgstr "**Zakaži preuzimanje vesti**: Omogućava vam da zakažete preuzimanje izabranih izvora vesti sa liste od stotina dostupnih. Zakazivanje se može podesiti pojedinačno za svaki izvor vesti koji izaberete, a zakazivanje je fleksibilno omogućavajući vam da izaberete određene dane u nedelji ili učestalost dana između preuzimanja."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:173
msgid ""
"**Add a custom news source**: Allows you to create a simple recipe for "
"downloading news from a custom news site that you wish to access.  Creating "
"the recipe can be as simple as specifying an RSS news feed URL, or you can "
"be more prescriptive by creating Python-based code for the task. For more "
"information, see :ref:`news`."
msgstr "**Dodaj prilagođeni izvor vesti**: Omogućava vam da kreirate jednostavan recept za preuzimanje vesti sa prilagođenog sajta sa vestima kojem želite da pristupite. Kreiranje recepta može biti jednostavno kao navođenje URL-a RSS feed-a, ili možete biti precizniji kreiranjem koda baziranog na Python-u za taj zadatak. Za više informacija, pogledajte :ref:`news`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:174
msgid ""
"**Download all scheduled news sources**: Causes calibre to immediately begin"
" downloading all news sources that you have scheduled."
msgstr "**Preuzmi sve zakazane izvore vesti**: Odmah pokreće preuzimanje svih izvora vesti koje ste zakazali."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:180
msgid "Library"
msgstr "Biblioteka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:184
msgid ""
"|lii| The :guilabel:`Library` action allows you to create, switch between, "
"rename or remove a Library.  calibre allows you to create as many libraries "
"as you wish. You could, for instance, create a fiction library, a non-"
"fiction library, a foreign language library, a project library, or any "
"structure that suits your needs. Libraries are the highest organizational "
"structure within calibre. Each library has its own set of books, tags, "
"categories and base storage location."
msgstr "|lii| Akcija :guilabel:`Biblioteka` vam omogućava da kreirate, prebacujete se između, preimenujete ili uklonite biblioteku. calibre vam omogućava da kreirate onoliko biblioteka koliko želite. Možete, na primer, kreirati biblioteku fikcije, biblioteku nefikcije, biblioteku stranih jezika, projektnu biblioteku, ili bilo koju strukturu koja odgovara vašim potrebama. Biblioteke su najviša organizaciona struktura unutar calibre-a. Svaka biblioteka ima svoj sopstveni skup knjiga, oznaka, kategorija i osnovnu lokaciju za skladištenje."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:181
msgid "lii"
msgstr "lii"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:186
msgid ""
"**Switch/create library...**: Allows you to; a) connect to a pre-existing "
"calibre library at another location, b) create an empty library at a new "
"location or, c) move the current library to a newly specified location."
msgstr "**Promeni/kreiraj biblioteku...**: Omogućava vam da; a) se povežete na već postojeću calibre biblioteku na drugoj lokaciji, b) kreirate praznu biblioteku na novoj lokaciji ili, c) premestite trenutnu biblioteku na novo navedenu lokaciju."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:187
msgid ""
"**Quick switch**: Allows you to switch between libraries that have been "
"registered or created within calibre."
msgstr "**Brza promena**: Omogućava vam da se prebacujete između biblioteka koje su registrovane ili kreirane unutar calibre-a."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:188
msgid "**Rename library**: Allows you to rename a Library."
msgstr "**Preimenuj biblioteku**: Omogućava vam da preimenujete biblioteku."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:189
msgid "**Pick a random book**: Chooses a random book in the library for you"
msgstr "**Izaberi nasumičnu knjigu**: Bira nasumičnu knjigu u biblioteci za vas"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:190
msgid "**Remove library**: Allows you to unregister a library from calibre."
msgstr "**Ukloni biblioteku**: Omogućava vam da odjavite biblioteku iz calibre-a."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:191
msgid ""
"**Export/import all calibre data**: Allows you to either export calibre data"
" for migration to a new computer or import previously exported data."
msgstr "**Izvezi/uvezi sve calibre podatke**: Omogućava vam da izvezete calibre podatke za migraciju na novi računar ili da uvezete prethodno izvezene podatke."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:192
msgid ""
"**<library name>**: Actions 7, 8 etc... give you immediate switch access "
"between multiple libraries that you have created or attached to. This list "
"contains only the 5 most frequently used libraries. For the complete list, "
"use the Quick Switch menu."
msgstr "**<ime biblioteke>**: Akcije 7, 8 itd... daju vam trenutni pristup za prebacivanje između više biblioteka koje ste kreirali ili prikačili. Ova lista sadrži samo 5 najčešće korišćenih biblioteka. Za kompletnu listu, koristite meni za brzo prebacivanje."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:193
msgid ""
"**Library maintenance**: Allows you to check the current library for data "
"consistency issues and restore the current library's database from backups."
msgstr "**Održavanje biblioteke**: Omogućava vam da proverite trenutnu biblioteku na probleme sa konzistentnošću podataka i da vratite bazu podataka trenutne biblioteke iz rezervnih kopija."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:195
msgid ""
"Metadata about your e-books, e.g. title, author, and tags, is stored in a "
"single file in your calibre library folder called metadata.db. If this file "
"gets corrupted (a very rare event), you can lose the metadata. Fortunately, "
"calibre automatically backs up the metadata for every individual book in the"
" book's folder as an OPF file. By using the Restore database action under "
"Library Maintenance described above, you can have calibre rebuild the "
"metadata.db file from the individual OPF files for you."
msgstr "Metapodaci o vašim e-knjigama, npr. naslov, autor i oznake, čuvaju se u jednoj datoteci u vašoj fascikli calibre biblioteke pod nazivom metadata.db. Ako se ova datoteka ošteti (veoma redak događaj), možete izgubiti metapodatke. Srećom, calibre automatski pravi rezervnu kopiju metapodataka za svaku pojedinačnu knjigu u fascikli knjige kao OPF datoteku. Korišćenjem akcije Vrati bazu podataka pod Održavanje biblioteke opisane iznad, možete naložiti calibre-u da ponovo izgradi datoteku metadata.db iz pojedinačnih OPF datoteka za vas."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:197
msgid ""
"You can copy or move books between different libraries (once you have more "
"than one library setup) by right clicking on the book and selecting the "
"action :guilabel:`Copy to library`."
msgstr "Možete kopirati ili premeštati knjige između različitih biblioteka (kada imate podešeno više od jedne biblioteke) desnim klikom na knjigu i odabirom akcije :guilabel:`Kopiraj u biblioteku`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:202
msgid "Device"
msgstr "Uređaj"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:206
msgid ""
"|dvi| The :guilabel:`Device` action allows you to view the books in the main"
" memory or storage cards of your device, or to eject the device (detach it "
"from calibre). This icon shows up automatically on the main calibre toolbar "
"when you connect a supported device. You can click on it to see the books on"
" your device. You can also drag and drop books from your calibre library "
"onto the icon to transfer them to your device. Conversely, you can drag and "
"drop books from your device onto the library icon on the toolbar to transfer"
" books from your device to the calibre library."
msgstr "|dvi| Akcija :guilabel:`Uređaj` vam omogućava da pregledate knjige u glavnoj memoriji ili na memorijskim karticama vašeg uređaja, ili da izbacite uređaj (odvojite ga od calibre-a). Ova ikona se automatski pojavljuje na glavnoj traci sa alatkama calibre-a kada povežete podržani uređaj. Možete kliknuti na nju da vidite knjige na vašem uređaju. Takođe možete prevući i otpustiti knjige iz vaše calibre biblioteke na ikonu da biste ih preneli na vaš uređaj. Obrnuto, možete prevući i otpustiti knjige sa vašeg uređaja na ikonu biblioteke na traci sa alatkama da biste preneli knjige sa vašeg uređaja u calibre biblioteku."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:203
msgid "dvi"
msgstr "dvi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:213
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:942
msgid "Save to disk"
msgstr "Sačuvaj na disku"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:217
msgid ""
"|svdi| The :guilabel:`Save to disk` action has five variations, accessed by "
"doing a right-click on the button."
msgstr "|svdi| Akcija :guilabel:`Sačuvaj na disku` ima pet varijacija, kojima se pristupa desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:214
msgid "svdi"
msgstr "svdi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:221
msgid ""
"**Save to disk**: Saves the selected books to disk organized in folders. The"
" folder structure looks like::"
msgstr "**Sačuvaj na disk**: Čuva izabrane knjige na disk organizovane u fascikle. Struktura fascikli izgleda ovako::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:227
msgid ""
"You can control the file name and folder structure of files saved to disk by"
" setting up a template in :guilabel:`Preferences->Import/export->Saving "
"books to disk`. Also see :ref:`templatelangcalibre`."
msgstr "Možete kontrolisati ime datoteke i strukturu fascikli datoteka sačuvanih na disk postavljanjem šablona u :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Uvoz/izvoz->Čuvanje knjiga na disk`. Takođe pogledajte :ref:`templatelangcalibre`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:232
msgid ""
"**Save to disk in a single folder**: Saves the selected books to disk in a "
"single folder."
msgstr "**Sačuvaj na disk u jednu fasciklu**: Čuva izabrane knjige na disk u jednu fasciklu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:234
msgid ""
"For 1. and 2., all available formats, as well as metadata, are stored to "
"disk for each selected book. Metadata is stored in an OPF file. Saved books "
"can be re-imported to the library without any loss of information by using "
"the :ref:`Add books <add_books>` action."
msgstr "Za 1. i 2., svi dostupni formati, kao i metapodaci, čuvaju se na disk za svaku izabranu knjigu. Metapodaci se čuvaju u OPF datoteci. Sačuvane knjige se mogu ponovo uvesti u biblioteku bez gubitka informacija korišćenjem akcije :ref:`Dodaj knjige <add_books>`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:236
msgid ""
"**Save only *<your preferred>* format to disk**: Saves the selected books to"
" disk in the folder structure as shown in (1.) but only in your preferred "
"e-book format. You can set your preferred format in "
":guilabel:`Preferences->Interface->Behaviour->Preferred output format`"
msgstr "**Sačuvaj samo *<vaš željeni>* format na disk**: Čuva izabrane knjige na disk u strukturi fascikli kao što je prikazano u (1.) ali samo u vašem željenom formatu e-knjige. Možete postaviti vaš željeni format u :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Interfejs->Ponašanje->Željeni izlazni format`"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:238
msgid ""
"**Save only *<your preferred>* format to disk in a single folder**: Saves "
"the selected books to disk in a single folder but only in your preferred "
"e-book format. You can set your preferred format in "
":guilabel:`Preferences->Interface->Behaviour->Preferred output format`"
msgstr "**Sačuvaj samo *<vaš željeni>* format na disk u jednu fasciklu**: Čuva izabrane knjige na disk u jednu fasciklu ali samo u vašem željenom formatu e-knjige. Možete postaviti vaš željeni format u :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Interfejs->Ponašanje->Željeni izlazni format`"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:240
msgid ""
"**Save single format to disk...**: Saves the selected books to disk in the "
"folder structure as shown in (1.) but only in the format you select from the"
" popup list."
msgstr "**Sačuvaj jedan format na disk...**: Čuva izabrane knjige na disk u strukturi foldera kao što je prikazano u (1.) ali samo u formatu koji izaberete iz iskačuće liste."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:245
msgid "Connect/share"
msgstr "Poveži/deli"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:249
msgid ""
"|csi| The :guilabel:`Connect/share` action allows you to manually connect to"
" a device or folder on your computer. It also allows you to set up your "
"calibre library for access via a web browser or email."
msgstr "|csi| Akcija :guilabel:`Poveži se/deli` vam omogućava da se ručno povežete sa uređajem ili folderom na vašem računaru. Takođe vam omogućava da podesite vašu calibre biblioteku za pristup preko veb pregledača ili e-pošte."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:246
msgid "csi"
msgstr "csi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:251
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Connect/share` action has four variations, accessed by doing "
"a right-click on the button."
msgstr "Akcija :guilabel:`Poveži se/deli` ima četiri varijacije, kojima se pristupa desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:253
msgid ""
"**Connect to folder**: Allows you to connect to any folder on your computer "
"as though it were a device and use all the facilities calibre has for "
"devices with that folder. Useful if your device cannot be supported by "
"calibre but is available as a USB disk."
msgstr "**Poveži se sa fasciklom**: Omogućava vam da se povežete sa bilo kojim folderom na vašem računaru kao da je uređaj i koristite sve mogućnosti koje calibre ima za uređaje sa tim folderom. Korisno ako vaš uređaj ne može biti podržan od strane calibre-a ali je dostupan kao USB disk."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:255
msgid ""
"**Start Content server**: Starts calibre's built-in web server.  When "
"started, your calibre library will be accessible via a web browser from the "
"Internet (if you choose). You can configure how the web server is accessed "
"by setting preferences at :guilabel:`Preferences->Sharing->Sharing over the "
"net`"
msgstr "**Pokreni server sadržaja**: Pokreće ugrađeni veb server calibre-a. Kada se pokrene, vaša calibre biblioteka će biti dostupna preko veb pregledača sa Interneta (ako izaberete). Možete podesiti kako se pristupa veb serveru podešavanjem opcija u :guilabel:`Podešavanja → Deljenje → Deljenje preko mreže`"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:257
msgid ""
"**Setup email based sharing of books**: Allows sharing of books and news "
"feeds by email.  After setting up email addresses for this option, calibre "
"will send news updates and book updates to the entered email addresses. You "
"can configure how calibre sends email by setting preferences at "
":guilabel:`Preferences->Sharing->Sharing books by email`. Once you have set "
"up one or more email addresses, this menu entry will be replaced by menu "
"entries to send books to the configured email addresses."
msgstr "**Podesi deljenje knjiga e-poštom**: Omogućava deljenje knjiga i vesti putem e-pošte. Nakon postavljanja adresa e-pošte za ovu opciju, calibre će slati ažuriranja vesti i knjiga na unete adrese e-pošte. Možete podesiti kako calibre šalje e-poštu podešavanjem opcija u :guilabel:`Podešavanja → Deljenje → Deljenje knjiga e-poštom`. Kada postavite jednu ili više adresa e-pošte, ova stavka menija će biti zamenjena stavkama menija za slanje knjiga na konfigurisane adrese e-pošte."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:262
msgid "Remove books"
msgstr "Ukloni knjige"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:266
msgid ""
"|rbi| The :guilabel:`Remove books` action **deletes books permanently**, so "
"use it with care. It is *context sensitive*, i.e. it depends on which "
":ref:`catalog <catalogs>` you have selected. If you have selected the "
":guilabel:`Library`, books will be removed from the library. If you have "
"selected the e-book reader device, books will be removed from the device. To"
" remove only a particular format for a given book use the "
":ref:`edit_meta_information` action.  Remove books also has five variations "
"which can be accessed by doing a right-click on the button."
msgstr "|rbi| Akcija :guilabel:`Ukloni knjige` **trajno briše knjige**, pa je koristite pažljivo. Ona je *osetljiva na kontekst*, tj. zavisi od toga koji :ref:`katalog <catalogs>` ste izabrali. Ako ste izabrali :guilabel:`Biblioteka`, knjige će biti uklonjene iz biblioteke. Ako ste izabrali uređaj za čitanje e-knjiga, knjige će biti uklonjene sa uređaja. Da biste uklonili samo određeni format za datu knjigu koristite akciju :ref:`edit_meta_information`. Remove books takođe ima pet varijacija kojima se može pristupiti desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:263
msgid "rbi"
msgstr "rbi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:268
msgid ""
"**Remove selected books**: Allows you to **permanently** remove all books "
"that are selected in the book list."
msgstr "**Ukloni izabrane knjige**: Omogućava vam da **trajno** uklonite sve knjige koje su izabrane na listi knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:270
msgid ""
"**Remove files of a specific format from selected books...**: Allows you to "
"**permanently** remove e-book files of a specified format from books that "
"are selected in the book list."
msgstr "**Ukloni fajlove određenog formata iz izabranih knjiga...**: Omogućava vam da **trajno** uklonite fajlove e-knjiga određenog formata iz knjiga koje su izabrane na listi knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:272
msgid ""
"**Remove all formats from selected books, except...**: Allows you to "
"**permanently** remove e-book files of any format except a specified format "
"from books that are selected in the book list."
msgstr "**Ukloni sve formate iz izabranih knjiga, osim...**: Omogućava vam da **trajno** uklonite fajlove e-knjiga bilo kog formata osim određenog formata iz knjiga koje su izabrane na listi knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:274
msgid ""
"**Remove all formats from selected books**: Allows you to **permanently** "
"remove all e-book files from books that are selected in the book list. Only "
"the metadata will remain."
msgstr "**Ukloni sve formate iz izabranih knjiga**: Omogućava vam da **trajno** uklonite sve fajlove e-knjiga iz knjiga koje su izabrane na listi knjiga. Ostaće samo metapodaci."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:276
msgid ""
"**Remove covers from selected books**: Allows you to **permanently** remove "
"cover image files from books that are selected in the book list."
msgstr "**Ukloni korice iz izabranih knjiga**: Omogućava vam da **trajno** uklonite fajlove slika korica iz knjiga koje su izabrane na listi knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:278
msgid ""
"**Remove matching books from device**: Allows you to remove e-book files "
"from a connected device that match the books that are selected in the book "
"list."
msgstr "**Ukloni odgovarajuće knjige sa uređaja**: Omogućava vam da uklonite fajlove e-knjiga sa povezanog uređaja koji odgovaraju knjigama koje su izabrane na listi knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:280
msgid ""
"**Restore recently deleted**: Allows you to undo the removal of books or "
"formats."
msgstr "**Vrati nedavno obrisano**: Omogućava vam da poništite uklanjanje knjiga ili formata."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:283
msgid ""
"Note that when you use :guilabel:`Remove books` to delete books from your "
"calibre library, the book record is deleted, but the books are temporarily "
"stored, for a few days, in a trash folder. You can undo the delete by right "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Remove books` button and choosing to "
":guilabel:`Restore recently deleted` books."
msgstr "Imajte na umu da kada koristite :guilabel:`Ukloni knjige` da obrišete knjige iz vaše calibre biblioteke, zapis o knjizi se briše, ali se knjige privremeno čuvaju, nekoliko dana, u fascikli za otpatke. Možete poništiti brisanje desnim klikom na dugme :guilabel:`Ukloni knjige` i biranjem opcije :guilabel:`Vrati nedavno obrisane` knjige."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:288
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Postavke"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:292
msgid ""
"|cbi| The :guilabel:`Preferences` action allows you to change the way "
"various aspects of calibre work. It has four variations, accessed by doing a"
" right-click on the button."
msgstr "|cbi| Akcija :guilabel:`Podešavanja` vam omogućava da promenite način na koji različiti aspekti calibre-a rade. Ima četiri varijacije, kojima se pristupa desnim klikom na dugme."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:289
msgid "cbi"
msgstr "cbi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:294
msgid ""
"**Preferences**: Allows you to change the way various aspects of calibre "
"work. Clicking the button also performs this action."
msgstr "**Podešavanja**: Omogućava vam da promenite način na koji različiti aspekti calibre-a rade. Klik na dugme takođe izvršava ovu akciju."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:295
msgid ""
"**Run Welcome wizard**: Allows you to start the :guilabel:`Welcome wizard` "
"which appeared the first time you started calibre."
msgstr "**Pokreni čarobnjaka za dobrodošlicu**: Omogućava vam da pokrenete :guilabel:`Čarobnjak za dobrodošlicu` koji se pojavio prvi put kada ste pokrenuli calibre."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:296
msgid ""
"**Get plugins to enhance calibre**: Opens a new window that shows plugins "
"for calibre. These plugins are developed by third parties to extend "
"calibre's functionality."
msgstr "**Preuzmi priključke za poboljšanje calibre-a**: Otvara novi prozor koji prikazuje priključke za calibre. Ove priključke razvijaju treće strane kako bi proširile funkcionalnost calibre-a."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:297
msgid ""
"**Restart in debug mode**: Allows you to enable a debugging mode that can "
"assist the calibre developers in solving problems you encounter with the "
"program. For most users this should remain disabled unless instructed by a "
"developer to enable it."
msgstr "**Ponovo pokreni u režimu za otklanjanje grešaka**: Omogućava vam da omogućite režim za otklanjanje grešaka koji može pomoći programerima calibre-a u rešavanju problema na koje naiđete sa programom. Za većinu korisnika ovo bi trebalo da ostane onemogućeno osim ako programer ne zatraži da ga omogućite."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:302
msgid "Catalogs"
msgstr "Katalozi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:306
msgid ""
"A *catalog* is a collection of books. calibre can manage two types of "
"different catalogs:"
msgstr "*Katalog* je kolekcija knjiga. calibre može upravljati sa dva različita tipa kataloga:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:308
msgid ""
"**Library**: This is a collection of books stored in your calibre library on"
" your computer."
msgstr "**Biblioteka**: Ovo je kolekcija knjiga sačuvanih u vašoj calibre biblioteci na vašem računaru."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:310
msgid ""
"**Device**:  This is a collection of books stored in your e-book reader. It "
"will be available when you connect the reader to your computer."
msgstr "**Uređaj**: Ovo je kolekcija knjiga sačuvanih na vašem čitaču e-knjiga. Biće dostupna kada povežete čitač sa računarom."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:312
msgid ""
"Many operations, such as adding books, deleting, viewing, etc., are context "
"sensitive. So, for example, if you click the :guilabel:`View` button when "
"you have the **Device** catalog selected, calibre will open the files on the"
" device to view. If you have the **Library** catalog selected, files in your"
" calibre library will be opened instead."
msgstr "Mnoge operacije, kao što su dodavanje knjiga, brisanje, pregledanje itd., zavise od konteksta. Tako, na primer, ako kliknete na dugme :guilabel:`Prikaz` kada je izabran katalog **Uređaj**, calibre će otvoriti datoteke na uređaju za pregled. Ako je izabran katalog **Biblioteka**, otvoriće se datoteke u vašoj calibre biblioteci."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:317
msgid "Search & sort"
msgstr "Pretraga i sortiranje"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:321
msgid ""
"The Search & Sort section allows you to perform several powerful actions on "
"your book collections."
msgstr "Odeljak Pretraga i sortiranje vam omogućava da izvršite nekoliko moćnih radnji na vašim kolekcijama knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:323
msgid ""
"You can sort them by title, author, date, rating, etc. by clicking on the "
"column titles. You can also sub-sort, i.e. sort on multiple columns. For "
"example, if you click on the title column and then the author column, the "
"book will be sorted by author and then all the entries for the same author "
"will be sorted by title."
msgstr "Možete ih sortirati po naslovu, autoru, datumu, oceni itd. klikom na naslove kolona. Možete ih i dodatno sortirati, tj. sortirati po više kolona. Na primer, ako kliknete na kolonu naslova, a zatim na kolonu autora, knjige će biti sortirane po autoru, a zatim će svi unosi za istog autora biti sortirani po naslovu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:328
msgid ""
"You can search for a particular book or set of books using the Search bar. "
"More on that below."
msgstr "Možete pretraživati određenu knjigu ili skup knjiga koristeći traku za pretragu. Više o tome u nastavku."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:330
msgid ""
"You can quickly and conveniently edit metadata by selecting the entry you "
"want changed in the list and pressing the :kbd:`E` key."
msgstr "Možete brzo i praktično uređivati metapodatke tako što ćete izabrati unos koji želite da promenite na listi i pritisnuti taster :kbd:`E`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:332
msgid ""
"You can perform :ref:`actions` on sets of books. To select multiple books "
"you can either:"
msgstr "Možete izvršiti :ref:`actions` na skupovima knjiga. Da biste izabrali više knjiga, možete:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:334
msgid ""
"Keep the :kbd:`Ctrl` key pressed and click on the books you want selected."
msgstr "Držite pritisnut taster :kbd:`Ctrl` i kliknite na knjige koje želite da izaberete."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:336
msgid ""
"Keep the :kbd:`Shift` key pressed and click on the starting and ending book "
"of a range of books you want selected."
msgstr "Držite pritisnut taster :kbd:`Shift` i kliknite na početnu i krajnju knjigu opsega knjiga koje želite da izaberete."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:338
msgid ""
"You can configure which fields you want displayed by using the "
":ref:`configuration` dialog."
msgstr "Možete podesiti koja polja želite da se prikazuju koristeći dijalog :ref:`configuration`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:340
msgid ""
"To perform complex multiple column based sub-sorting add the :guilabel:`Sort"
" by` tool to a toolbar via :guilabel:`Preferences->Toolbars & menus`."
msgstr "Da biste izvršili složeno sortiranje zasnovano na više kolona, dodajte alatku :guilabel:`Sortiraj po` na traku sa alatkama preko :guilabel:`Podešavanja → Trake sa alatkama i meniji`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:346
msgid "The search interface"
msgstr "Interfejs za pretragu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:347
msgid ""
"You can search all book metadata by entering search terms in the Search bar."
" For example::"
msgstr "Možete pretraživati sve metapodatke knjiga unosom termina za pretragu u traku za pretragu. Na primer::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:351
msgid ""
"This will match all books in your library that have ``Asimov`` and "
"``Foundation`` in their metadata and are available in the LRF format. Some "
"more examples::"
msgstr "Ovo će pronaći sve knjige u vašoj biblioteci koje imaju ``Asimov`` i ``Foundation`` u svojim metapodacima i dostupne su u LRF formatu. Još nekoliko primera::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:360
msgid "*Search kinds*"
msgstr "*Vrste pretrage*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:362
msgid ""
"There are four search kinds: `contains`, `equality`, `regular expression` "
"(see `regular expressions "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regular_expression>`_), and `character "
"variant`. You choose the search kind with a prefix character."
msgstr "Postoje četiri vrste pretrage: `sadrži`, `jednakost`, `regularni izraz` (videti `regularne izraze <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regular_expression>`_) i `varijanta karaktera`. Vrstu pretrage birate pomoću prefiksnog karaktera."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:364
msgid "*'Contains' searches*"
msgstr "*Pretrage 'Sadrži'*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:366
msgid ""
"Searches with no prefix character are `contains` and are by default case "
"insensitive. An item matches if the search string appears anywhere in the "
"indicated metadata. You can make `contains` searches case sensitive by "
"checking the option `Case sensitive searching` in :guilabel:`Preferences / "
"Searching`. If the search option `Unaccented characters match accented "
"characters and punctuation is ignored` is checked then a character will "
"match all its variants (e.g., `e` matches `é`, `è`, `ê`, and `ë`) and all "
"punctuation and whitespace are ignored. For example, if the `Unaccented "
"characters match ...` option is checked then given the two book titles:"
msgstr "Pretrage bez prefiksnog karaktera su `sadrži` i podrazumevano ne razlikuju velika i mala slova. Stavka se podudara ako se string za pretragu pojavi bilo gde u naznačenim metapodacima. Pretrage `sadrži` možete učiniti osetljivim na velika i mala slova tako što ćete označiti opciju `Pretraga osetljiva na velika i mala slova` u :guilabel:`Podešavanja / Pretraga`. Ako je opcija pretrage `Karakteri bez akcenta se podudaraju sa akcentovanim karakterima i interpunkcija se ignoriše` označena, onda će se karakter podudarati sa svim svojim varijantama (npr. `e` se podudara sa `é`, `è`, `ê` i `ë`) i sva interpunkcija i razmaci se ignorišu. Na primer, ako je opcija `Karakteri bez akcenta se podudaraju...` označena, onda s obzirom na dva naslova knjiga:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:368
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:418
msgid "Big, Bothéred, and Bad"
msgstr "Big, Bothéred, and Bad"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:369
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:419
msgid "Big Bummer"
msgstr "Big Bummer"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:371
msgid "then these searches find:"
msgstr "onda ove pretrage pronalaze:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:373
msgid "``title:\"er\"`` matches both ('e' matches both 'é' and 'e')."
msgstr "``title:\"er\"`` se podudara sa oba ('e' se podudara i sa 'é' i sa 'e')."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:374
msgid "``title:\"g \"`` matches both because spaces are ignored."
msgstr "``title:\"g \"`` se podudara sa oba jer se razmaci ignorišu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:375
msgid "``title:\"g,\"`` matches both because the comma is ignored."
msgstr "``title:\"g,\"`` se podudara sa oba jer se zarez ignoriše."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:376
msgid ""
"``title:\"gb\"`` matches both because ', ' is ignored in book 1 and spaces "
"are ignored in book 2."
msgstr "``title:\"gb\"`` se podudara sa oba jer se ', ' ignoriše u knjizi 1, a razmaci se ignorišu u knjizi 2."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:377
msgid "``title:\"g b\"`` matches both because comma and space are ignored."
msgstr "``title:\"g b\"`` se podudara sa oba jer se zarez i razmak ignorišu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:378
msgid "``title:\"db\"`` matches #1 because the space in 'and Bad' is ignored."
msgstr "``title:\"db\"`` se podudara sa #1 jer se razmak u 'and Bad' ignoriše."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:379
msgid ""
"``title:\",\"`` matches both (it actually matches all books) because commas "
"are ignored."
msgstr "``title:\",\"`` se podudara sa oba (zapravo se podudara sa svim knjigama) jer se zarezi ignorišu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:381
msgid ""
"If the `Unaccented characters match ...` option is not checked then "
"character variants, punctuation, and spacing are all significant."
msgstr "Ako opcija `Unaccented characters match ...` nije označena, onda su varijante znakova, interpunkcija i razmaci značajni."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:383
msgid ""
"You can set only one of the search options `Case sensitive searching` and "
"`Unaccented characters match accented characters and punctuation is "
"ignored`."
msgstr "Možete postaviti samo jednu od opcija pretrage `Case sensitive searching` i `Unaccented characters match accented characters and punctuation is ignored`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:385
msgid "*'Equality' searches*"
msgstr "*Pretrage 'jednakosti'*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:387
msgid ""
"Equality searches are indicated by prefixing the search string with an "
"equals sign (=). For example, the query ``tag:\"=science\"`` will match "
"`science`, but not `science fiction` or `hard science`. Character variants "
"are significant: `é` doesn't match `e`."
msgstr "Pretrage jednakosti su označene dodavanjem znaka jednakosti (=) ispred niske za pretragu. Na primer, upit ``tag:\"=science\"`` će se podudarati sa `science`, ali ne i sa `science fiction` ili `hard science`. Varijante karaktera su važne: `é` se ne podudara sa `e`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:390
msgid ""
"Two variants of equality searches are used for hierarchical items (e.g., "
"A.B.C): hierarchical prefix searches and hierarchical component searches. "
"The first, indicated by a single period after the equals (``=.``) matches "
"the initial parts of a hierarchical item. The second, indicated by two "
"periods after the equals (``=..``) matches an internal name in the "
"hierarchical item. Examples, using the tag ``History.Military.WWII`` as the "
"value:"
msgstr "Dve varijante pretraga jednakosti se koriste za hijerarhijske stavke (npr. A.B.C): pretrage hijerarhijskog prefiksa i pretrage hijerarhijske komponente. Prva, označena jednom tačkom posle znaka jednakosti (``=.``) podudara se sa početnim delovima hijerarhijske stavke. Druga, označena sa dve tačke posle znaka jednakosti (``=..``) podudara se sa unutrašnjim imenom u hijerarhijskoj stavci. Primeri, koristeći oznaku ``History.Military.WWII`` kao vrednost:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:392
msgid "``tags:\"=.History\"`` : True. ``History`` is a prefix of the tag."
msgstr "``tags:\"=.History\"`` : Tačno. ``History`` je prefiks oznake."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:393
msgid ""
"``tags:\"=.History.Military\"`` : True. ``History.Military`` is a prefix of "
"the tag."
msgstr "``tags:\"=.History.Military\"`` : Tačno. ``History.Military`` je prefiks oznake."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:394
msgid ""
"``tags:\"=.History.Military.WWII\"`` : True. ``History.Military.WWII`` is a "
"prefix of the tag, albeit an improper one."
msgstr "``tags:\"=.History.Military.WWII\"`` : Tačno. ``History.Military.WWII`` je prefiks oznake, iako nepravilan."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:395
msgid "``tags:\"=.Military\"`` : False. ``Military`` is not a prefix of the tag."
msgstr "``tags:\"=.Military\"`` : Netačno. ``Military`` nije prefiks oznake."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:396
msgid "``tags:\"=.WWII\"`` : False. ``WWII`` is not a prefix of the tag."
msgstr "``tags:\"=.WWII\"`` : Netačno. ``WWII`` nije prefiks oznake."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:397
msgid ""
"``tags:\"=..History\"`` : True. The hierarchy contains the value "
"``History``."
msgstr "``tags:\"=..History\"`` : Tačno. Hijerarhija sadrži vrednost ``History``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:398
msgid ""
"``tags:\"=..Military\"`` : True. The hierarchy contains the value "
"``Military``."
msgstr "``tags:\"=..Military\"`` : Tačno. Hijerarhija sadrži vrednost ``Military``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:399
msgid "``tags:\"=..WWII\"`` : True. The hierarchy contains the value ``WWII``."
msgstr "``tags:\"=..WWII\"`` : Tačno. Hijerarhija sadrži vrednost ``WWII``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:400
msgid ""
"``tags:\"=..Military.WWII\"`` : False. The ``..`` search looks for single "
"values."
msgstr "``tags:\"=..Military.WWII\"`` : Netačno. Pretraga ``..`` traži pojedinačne vrednosti."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:402
msgid "*'Regular expression' searches*"
msgstr "*Pretrage 'Regularnim izrazima'*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:404
msgid ""
"Regular expression searches are indicated by prefixing the search string "
"with a tilde (~). Any `Python-compatible regular expression "
"<https://docs.python.org/library/re.html>`__ can be used. Backslashes used "
"to escape special characters in regular expressions must be doubled because "
"single backslashes will be removed during query parsing. For example, to "
"match a literal parenthesis you must enter ``\\\\(`` or alternatively use "
"`super-quotes` (see below). Regular expression searches are 'contains' "
"searches unless the expression is anchored. Character variants are "
"significant: ``~e`` doesn't match ``é``."
msgstr "Pretrage regularnim izrazima su označene prefiksom tilda (~) ispred niske za pretragu. Bilo koji `Python-kompatibilan regularni izraz <https://docs.python.org/library/re.html>`__ se može koristiti. Obrnute kose crte koje se koriste za izbegavanje specijalnih karaktera u regularnim izrazima moraju biti udvostručene jer će pojedinačne obrnute kose crte biti uklonjene tokom parsiranja upita. Na primer, da biste uparili doslovnu zagradu morate uneti ``\\\\(`` ili alternativno koristiti `super-navodnike` (videti ispod). Pretrage regularnim izrazima su 'sadrži' pretrage osim ako izraz nije usidren. Varijante karaktera su značajne: ``~e`` se ne poklapa sa ``é``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:406
msgid "*'Character variant' searches*"
msgstr "*Pretrage 'Varijantama karaktera'*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:408
msgid ""
"Character variant searches are indicated by prefixing the search string with"
" a caret (^). This search is similar to the `contains` search (above) except"
" that:"
msgstr "Pretrage varijantama karaktera su označene prefiksom kapica (^) ispred niske za pretragu. Ova pretraga je slična pretrazi `sadrži` (iznad) osim što:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:410
msgid "letter case is always ignored."
msgstr "veličina slova se uvek ignoriše."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:411
msgid "character variants always match each other."
msgstr "varijante karaktera se uvek podudaraju."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:412
msgid "punctuation and whitespace are always significant."
msgstr "interpunkcija i razmaci su uvek značajni."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:414
msgid ""
"The search options :guilabel:`Unaccented characters match accented "
"characters and punctuation is ignored` and :guilabel:`Case sensitive "
"searching` are ignored. They have no effect on this search's behavior."
msgstr "Opcije pretrage :guilabel:`Karakteri bez akcenta se podudaraju sa akcentovanim karakterima i interpunkcija se ignoriše` i :guilabel:`Pretraga osetljiva na veličinu slova` se ignorišu. One nemaju uticaja na ponašanje ove pretrage."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:416
msgid ""
"The following compares this search to a contains search assuming the "
":guilabel:`Unaccented characters match...` option is checked (see above) "
"given the same two book titles:"
msgstr "Sledeće upoređuje ovu pretragu sa pretragom koja sadrži, pod pretpostavkom da je opcija :guilabel:`Karakteri bez akcenta se podudaraju...` označena (videti iznad) za ista dva naslova knjiga:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:421
msgid "then these character variant searches find:"
msgstr "onda ove pretrage varijanti karaktera pronalaze:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:423
msgid "``title:\"^er\"`` matches both ('e' matches both 'é' and 'e')"
msgstr "``title:\"^er\"`` pronalazi oba ('e' se podudara i sa 'é' i sa 'e')"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:424
msgid "``title:\"^g\"`` matches both"
msgstr "``title:\"^g\"`` pronalazi oba"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:425
msgid "``title:\"^g \"`` matches #2 because the space is significant"
msgstr "``title:\"^g \"`` se podudara sa #2 jer je razmak značajan"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:426
msgid "``title:\"^g,\"`` matches #1 because the comma is significant"
msgstr "``title:\"^g,\"`` se podudara sa #1 jer je zarez značajan"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:427
msgid "``title:\"^gb\"`` matches nothing because space and comma are significant"
msgstr "``title:\"^gb\"`` se ne podudara ni sa čim jer su razmak i zarez značajni"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:428
msgid "``title:\"^g b\"`` matches #2 because the comma is significant"
msgstr "``title:\"^g b\"`` se podudara sa #2 jer je zarez značajan"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:429
msgid "``title:\"^db\"`` matches nothing"
msgstr "``title:\"^db\"`` se ne podudara ni sa čim"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:430
msgid ""
"``title:\"^,\"`` matches #1 (instead of all books) because the comma is "
"significant"
msgstr "``title:\"^,\"`` se podudara sa #1 (umesto sa svim knjigama) jer je zarez značajan"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:432
msgid "*Search Expression Syntax*"
msgstr "*Sintaksa izraza za pretragu*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:434
msgid ""
"A `search expression` is a sequence of `search terms` optionally separated "
"by the operators ``and`` and ``or``. If two search terms occur without a "
"separating operator, ``and`` is assumed. The ``and`` operator has priority "
"over the ``or`` operator; for example the expression ``a or b and c`` is the"
" same as ``a or (b and c)``. You can use parenthesis to change the priority;"
" for example ``(a or b) and c`` to make the ``or`` evaluate before the "
"``and``. You can use the operator ``not`` to negate (invert) the result of "
"evaluating a search expression. Examples:"
msgstr "`Izraz za pretragu` je niz `termina za pretragu` opciono razdvojenih operatorima ``and`` i ``or``. Ako se dva termina za pretragu pojave bez operatora razdvajanja, podrazumeva se ``and``. Operator ``and`` ima prioritet nad operatorom ``or``; na primer, izraz ``a or b and c`` je isto što i ``a or (b and c)``. Možete koristiti zagrade da promenite prioritet; na primer ``(a or b) and c`` da bi se ``or`` procenio pre ``and``. Možete koristiti operator ``not`` da negirate (invertujete) rezultat procene izraza za pretragu. Primeri:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:436
msgid "``not tag:foo`` finds all books that don't contain the tag ``foo``"
msgstr "``not tag:foo`` pronalazi sve knjige koje ne sadrže oznaku ``foo``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:437
msgid ""
"``not (author:Asimov or author:Weber)`` finds all books not written by "
"either Asimov or Weber."
msgstr "``not (author:Asimov or author:Weber)`` pronalazi sve knjige koje nisu napisali ni Asimov ni Weber."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:439
msgid ""
"The above examples show examples of `search terms`. A basic `search term` is"
" a sequence of characters not including spaces, quotes (``\"``), backslashes"
" (``\\``), or parentheses (``( )``). It can be optionally preceded by a "
"column name specifier: the `lookup name` of a column followed by a colon "
"(``:``), for example ``author:Asimov``. If a search term must contain a "
"space then the entire term must be enclosed in quotes, as in ``title:\"The "
"Ring\"``. If the search term must contain quotes then they must be `escaped`"
" with backslashes. For example, to search for a series named `The \"Ball\" "
"and The \"Chain\"`, use::"
msgstr "Gore navedeni primeri prikazuju primere `search terms` (pojmova za pretragu). Osnovni `search term` je niz karaktera koji ne uključuje razmake, navodnike (``\"``), obrnute kose crte (``\\``) ili zagrade (``( )``). Može mu opciono prethoditi specifikator imena kolone: `lookup name` (ime za pretragu) kolone praćeno dvotačkom (``:``), na primer ``author:Asimov``. Ako pojam za pretragu mora da sadrži razmak, onda ceo pojam mora biti pod navodnicima, kao u ``title:\"The Ring\"``. Ako pojam za pretragu mora da sadrži navodnike, onda oni moraju biti `escaped` (izbegnuti) obrnutim kosim crtama. Na primer, da biste pretražili serijal pod nazivom `The \"Ball\" and The \"Chain\"`, koristite::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:443
msgid ""
"If you need an actual backslash, something that happens frequently in "
"`regular expression` searches, use two of them (``\\\\``)."
msgstr "Ako vam je potrebna stvarna obrnuta kosa crta, što se često dešava u pretragama sa `regular expression` (regularnim izrazima), koristite dve (``\\\\``)."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:445
msgid ""
"It is sometimes hard to get all the escapes right so the result is what you "
"want, especially in `regular expression` and `template` searches. In these "
"cases use the `super-quote`: ``\"\"\"sequence of characters\"\"\"``. Super-"
"quoted characters are used unchanged: no escape processing is done."
msgstr "Ponekad je teško pravilno postaviti sve izbegavajuće karaktere kako bi rezultat bio onakav kakav želite, posebno u pretragama sa `regular expression` i `template`. U ovim slučajevima koristite `super-quote` (super-navodnike): ``\"\"\"sequence of characters\"\"\"``. Karakteri pod super-navodnicima se koriste neizmenjeni: ne vrši se obrada izbegavanja."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:447
msgid "*More information*"
msgstr "*Više informacija*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:449
msgid ""
"To search for a string that begins with an equals, tilde, or caret; prefix "
"the string with a backslash."
msgstr "Da biste pretražili string koji počinje znakom jednakosti, tildom ili znakom za umetanje (caret); stavite obrnutu kosu crtu ispred stringa."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:451
msgid ""
"Enclose search strings with quotes (\") if the string contains parenthesis "
"or spaces. For example, to find books with the tag ``Science Fiction`` you "
"must search for ``tag:\"=science fiction\"``. If you search for "
"``tag:=science fiction`` you will find all books with the tag ``science`` "
"and the word ``fiction`` in any metadata."
msgstr "Stavite stringove za pretragu pod navodnike (\") ako string sadrži zagrade ili razmake. Na primer, da biste pronašli knjige sa oznakom ``Science Fiction`` morate pretražiti ``tag:\"=science fiction\"``. Ako pretražujete ``tag:=science fiction`` pronaći ćete sve knjige sa oznakom ``science`` i rečju ``fiction`` u bilo kojim metapodacima."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:453
msgid ""
"You can build advanced search queries easily using the :guilabel:`Advanced "
"search dialog` accessed by clicking the button |sbi| on the left of the "
"search box."
msgstr "Možete lako kreirati napredne upite za pretragu koristeći :guilabel:`Dijalog za naprednu pretragu` kojem se pristupa klikom na dugme |sbi| sa leve strane polja za pretragu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:577
msgid "sbi"
msgstr "sbi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:456
msgid ""
"Available fields for searching are: ``tag, title, author, publisher, series,"
" series_index, rating, cover, comments, format, identifiers, date, pubdate, "
"search, size, vl`` and custom columns. If a device is plugged in, the "
"``ondevice`` field becomes available, when searching the calibre library "
"view. To find the search name (actually called the `lookup name`) for a "
"custom column, hover your mouse over the column header in the library view."
msgstr "Dostupna polja za pretragu su: ``tag, title, author, publisher, series, series_index, rating, cover, comments, format, identifiers, date, pubdate, search, size, vl`` i prilagođene kolone. Ako je uređaj priključen, polje ``ondevice`` postaje dostupno prilikom pretrage prikaza calibre biblioteke. Da biste pronašli ime za pretragu (zapravo nazvano `lookup name`) za prilagođenu kolonu, pređite mišem preko zaglavlja kolone u prikazu biblioteke."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:458
msgid "*Dates*"
msgstr "*Datumi*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:460
msgid "The syntax for searching for dates is::"
msgstr "Sintaksa za pretragu datuma je::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:466
msgid ""
"If the date is ambiguous then the current locale is used for date "
"comparison. For example, in an mm/dd/yyyy locale 2/1/2009 is interpreted as "
"1 Feb 2009. In a dd/mm/yyyy locale it is interpreted as 2 Jan 2009.  Some "
"special date strings are available. The string ``today`` translates to "
"today's date, whatever it is. The strings ``yesterday`` and ``thismonth`` "
"(or the translated equivalent in the current language) also work. In "
"addition, the string ``daysago`` (also translated) can be used to compare to"
" a date some number of days ago. For example::"
msgstr "Ako je datum dvosmislen, za poređenje datuma se koristi trenutni lokalitet. Na primer, u lokalitetu mm/dd/yyyy 2/1/2009 se tumači kao 1. feb 2009. U lokalitetu dd/mm/yyyy se tumači kao 2. jan 2009. Dostupni su neki posebni stringovi za datume. String ``today`` se prevodi u današnji datum, koji god da je. Stringovi ``yesterday`` i ``thismonth`` (ili prevedeni ekvivalent na trenutnom jeziku) takođe rade. Pored toga, string ``daysago`` (takođe preveden) može se koristiti za poređenje sa datumom pre određenog broja dana. Na primer::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:476
msgid ""
"To avoid potential problems with translated strings when using a non-English"
" version of calibre, the strings ``_today``, ``_yesterday``, ``_thismonth``,"
" and ``_daysago`` are always available. They are not translated."
msgstr "Da bi se izbegli potencijalni problemi sa prevedenim stringovima kada se koristi verzija calibre-a koja nije na engleskom, stringovi ``_today``, ``_yesterday``, ``_thismonth`` i ``_daysago`` su uvek dostupni. Oni se ne prevode."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:478
msgid "*Searching dates and numeric values with relational comparisons*"
msgstr "*Pretraga datuma i numeričkih vrednosti sa relacionim poređenjima*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:480
msgid ""
"Dates and numeric fields support the relational operators ``=`` (equals), "
"``>`` (greater than), ``>=`` (greater than or equal to), ``<`` (less than), "
"``<=`` (less than or equal to), and ``!=`` (not equal to). Rating fields are"
" considered to be numeric. For example, the search ``rating:>=3`` will find "
"all books rated 3 or higher."
msgstr "Datumi i numerička polja podržavaju relacione operatore ``=`` (jednako), ``>`` (veće od), ``>=`` (veće ili jednako), ``<`` (manje od), ``<=`` (manje ili jednako), i ``!=`` (nije jednako). Polja za ocenu se smatraju numeričkim. Na primer, pretraga ``rating:>=3`` će pronaći sve knjige ocenjene sa 3 ili više."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:485
msgid ""
"You can search for books that have a format of a certain size like this:"
msgstr "Možete pretraživati knjige koje imaju format određene veličine ovako:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:487
msgid "``size:>1.1M`` will find books with a format larger than 1.1MB"
msgstr "``size:>1.1M`` će pronaći knjige sa formatom većim od 1.1MB"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:488
msgid ""
"``size:<=1K``  will find books with a format smaller than or equal to 1KB"
msgstr "``size:<=1K`` će pronaći knjige sa formatom manjim ili jednakim 1KB"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:490
msgid ""
"You can search for the number of items in multiple-valued fields such as "
"tags using the character ``#`` then using the same syntax as numeric fields."
" For example, to find all books with more than 4 tags use ``tags:#>4``. To "
"find all books with exactly 10 tags use ``tags:#=10``."
msgstr "Možete pretraživati broj stavki u poljima sa više vrednosti kao što su oznake koristeći karakter ``#`` a zatim koristeći istu sintaksu kao za numerička polja. Na primer, da biste pronašli sve knjige sa više od 4 oznake koristite ``tags:#>4``. Da biste pronašli sve knjige sa tačno 10 oznaka koristite ``tags:#=10``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:492
msgid "*Series indices*"
msgstr "*Indeksi serija*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:494
msgid ""
"Series indices are searchable. For the standard series, the search name is "
"``series_index``. For custom series columns, use the column search name "
"followed by _index. For example, to search the indices for a custom series "
"column named ``#my_series``, you would use the search name "
"``#my_series_index``. Series indices are numbers, so you can use the "
"relational operators described above."
msgstr "Indeksi serija se mogu pretraživati. Za standardne serije, ime pretrage je ``series_index``. Za prilagođene kolone serija, koristite ime pretrage kolone praćeno sa _index. Na primer, da biste pretražili indekse za prilagođenu kolonu serije nazvanu ``#my_series``, koristili biste ime pretrage ``#my_series_index``. Indeksi serija su brojevi, tako da možete koristiti relacione operatore opisane iznad."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:499
msgid "*Saved searches*"
msgstr "*Sačuvane pretrage*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:501
msgid ""
"The special field ``search`` is used for :ref:`saved searches "
"<saved_searches>`. If you save a search with the name \"My spouse's books\" "
"you can enter ``search:\"My spouse's books\"`` in the Search bar to reuse "
"the saved search. More about saving searches below."
msgstr "Posebno polje ``search`` koristi se za :ref:`sačuvane pretrage <saved_searches>`. Ako sačuvate pretragu pod imenom \"My spouse's books\", možete uneti ``search:\"My spouse's books\"`` u polje za pretragu da biste je ponovo upotrebili. Više o čuvanju pretraga pročitajte u nastavku."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:505
msgid "*Virtual libraries*"
msgstr "*Virtuelne biblioteke*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:507
msgid ""
"The special field ``vl`` is used to search for books in a Virtual library. "
"For example, ``vl:Read`` will find all the books in the *Read* Virtual "
"library. The search ``vl:Read and vl:\"Science Fiction\"`` will find all the"
" books that are in both the *Read* and *Science Fiction* virtual libraries. "
"The value following ``vl:`` must be the name of a Virtual library. If the "
"Virtual library name contains spaces then surround it with quotes."
msgstr "Specijalno polje ``vl`` se koristi za pretragu knjiga u Virtuelnoj biblioteci. Na primer, ``vl:Read`` će pronaći sve knjige u *Read* Virtuelnoj biblioteci. Pretraga ``vl:Read and vl:\"Science Fiction\"`` će pronaći sve knjige koje su u obe virtuelne biblioteke, *Read* i *Science Fiction*. Vrednost koja sledi nakon ``vl:`` mora biti ime Virtuelne biblioteke. Ako ime Virtuelne biblioteke sadrži razmake, stavite ga pod navodnike."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:513
msgid "*Whether a field has a value*"
msgstr "*Da li polje ima vrednost*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:515
msgid ""
"You can search for the absence or presence of a value for a field using "
"\"true\" and \"false\". For example:"
msgstr "Možete pretraživati odsustvo ili prisustvo vrednosti za polje koristeći \"true\" i \"false\". Na primer:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:517
msgid "``cover:false`` finds all books without a cover"
msgstr "``cover:false`` pronalazi sve knjige bez korica"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:518
msgid "``series:true`` finds all books that are in a series"
msgstr "``series:true`` pronalazi sve knjige koje su u seriji"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:519
msgid "``series:false`` finds all books that are not in a series"
msgstr "``series:false`` pronalazi sve knjige koje nisu u seriji"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:520
msgid "``comments:false`` finds all books with an empty comment"
msgstr "``comments:false`` pronalazi sve knjige sa praznim komentarom"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:521
msgid "``formats:false`` finds all books with no book files (empty records)"
msgstr "``formats:false`` pronalazi sve knjige bez fajlova knjiga (prazni zapisi)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:523
msgid "*Yes/no custom columns*"
msgstr "*Da/ne prilagođene kolone*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:525
msgid ""
"Searching Yes/no custom columns for ``false``, ``empty``, or ``blank`` will "
"find all books with undefined values in the column. Searching for ``true`` "
"will find all books that do not have undefined values in the column. "
"Searching for ``yes`` or ``checked`` will find all books with ``Yes`` in the"
" column. Searching for ``no`` or ``unchecked`` will find all books with "
"``No`` in the column. Note that the words ``yes``, ``no``, ``blank``, "
"``empty``, ``checked`` and ``unchecked`` are translated; you can use either "
"the current language's equivalent word or the English word. The words "
"``true`` and ``false`` and the special values ``_yes``, ``_no``, and "
"``_empty`` are not translated."
msgstr "Pretragom prilagođene kolone Da/ne pomoću ``false``, ``empty`` ili ``blank`` pronalaze se knjige bez definisane vrednosti u toj koloni. Pretragom pomoću ``true`` pronalaze se knjige sa definisanom vrednošću. ``yes`` ili ``checked`` pronalazi knjige sa vrednošću ``Yes``, a ``no`` ili ``unchecked`` knjige sa vrednošću ``No``. Reči ``yes``, ``no``, ``blank``, ``empty``, ``checked`` i ``unchecked`` se prevode; možete koristiti njihov srpski ili engleski oblik. Reči ``true`` i ``false`` i posebne vrednosti ``_yes``, ``_no`` i ``_empty`` ne prevode se."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:530
msgid "*Identifiers*"
msgstr "*Identifikatori*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:532
msgid ""
"Identifiers (e.g., ISBN, DOI, LCCN, etc.) use an extended syntax. An "
"identifier has the form ``type:value``, as in ``isbn:123456789``. The "
"extended syntax permits you to specify independently the type and value to "
"search for. Both the type and the value parts of the query can use any of "
"the :ref:`search kinds <search_kinds>`. Examples:"
msgstr "Identifikatori (npr. ISBN, DOI i LCCN) koriste proširenu sintaksu. Identifikator ima oblik ``type:value``, kao u ``isbn:123456789``. Proširena sintaksa omogućava da zasebno odredite tip i vrednost za pretragu. Za oba dela upita možete koristiti bilo koju od :ref:`vrsta pretrage <search_kinds>`. Primeri:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:534
msgid "``identifiers:true`` will find books with any identifier."
msgstr "``identifiers:true`` će pronaći knjige sa bilo kojim identifikatorom."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:535
msgid "``identifiers:false`` will find books with no identifier."
msgstr "``identifiers:false`` će pronaći knjige bez identifikatora."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:536
msgid ""
"``identifiers:123`` will search for books with any type having a value "
"containing `123`."
msgstr "``identifiers:123`` će tražiti knjige sa bilo kojim tipom koji ima vrednost koja sadrži `123`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:537
msgid ""
"``identifiers:=123456789`` will search for books with any type having a "
"value equal to `123456789`."
msgstr "``identifiers:=123456789`` će tražiti knjige sa bilo kojim tipom koji ima vrednost jednaku `123456789`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:538
msgid ""
"``identifiers:=isbn:`` and ``identifiers:isbn:true`` will find books with a "
"type equal to ISBN having any value"
msgstr "``identifiers:=isbn:`` i ``identifiers:isbn:true`` će naći knjige sa tipom jednakim ISBN koje imaju bilo koju vrednost"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:539
msgid ""
"``identifiers:=isbn:false`` will find books with no type equal to ISBN."
msgstr "``identifiers:=isbn:false`` će naći knjige koje nemaju tip jednak ISBN."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:540
msgid ""
"``identifiers:=isbn:123`` will find books with a type equal to ISBN having a"
" value containing `123`."
msgstr "``identifiers:=isbn:123`` će naći knjige sa tipom jednakim ISBN koje imaju vrednost koja sadrži `123`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:541
msgid ""
"``identifiers:=isbn:=123456789`` will find books with a type equal to ISBN "
"having a value equal to `123456789`."
msgstr "``identifiers:=isbn:=123456789`` će naći knjige sa tipom jednakim ISBN koje imaju vrednost jednaku `123456789`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:542
msgid ""
"``identifiers:i:1`` will find books with a type containing an `i` having a "
"value containing a `1`."
msgstr "``identifiers:i:1`` će naći knjige sa tipom koji sadrži `i` i ima vrednost koja sadrži `1`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:544
msgid "*Categories visible in the Tag browser*"
msgstr "*Kategorije vidljive u Pregledaču oznaka*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:546
msgid ""
"The search ``in_tag_browser:true`` finds all books that are in categories "
"(tags, authors, etc.) currently shown in the :guilabel:`Tag browser`. This "
"is useful if you set the two preferences :guilabel:`Preferences->Look & "
"feel->Tag browser->Hide empty categories` and :guilabel:`Find shows all "
"items that match`. With those two preferences set, doing a :guilabel:`Find` "
"in the :guilabel:`Tag browser` shows only categories containing items "
"matched by the :guilabel:`Find`. Then, the search ``in_tag_browser:true`` "
"additionally finds books with these categories / items. You can easily run "
"this search by pressing the key :kbd:`Ctrl+Alt+Shift+F` or clicking the "
"configure button in the :guilabel:`Tag browser` and choosing the "
":guilabel:`Show only books that have visible categories` entry."
msgstr "Pretraga ``in_tag_browser:true`` pronalazi sve knjige koje su u kategorijama (oznake, autori, itd.) trenutno prikazanim u :guilabel:`Pregledaču oznaka`. Ovo je korisno ako postavite dve opcije :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Izgled i osećaj->Pregledač oznaka->Sakrij prazne kategorije` i :guilabel:`Pronađi prikazuje sve stavke koje se podudaraju`. Sa te dve postavljene opcije, obavljanje :guilabel:`Pronađi` u :guilabel:`Pregledaču oznaka` prikazuje samo kategorije koje sadrže stavke koje se podudaraju sa :guilabel:`Pronađi`. Zatim, pretraga ``in_tag_browser:true`` dodatno pronalazi knjige sa ovim kategorijama / stavkama. Ovu pretragu možete lako pokrenuti pritiskom na taster :kbd:`Ctrl+Alt+Shift+F` ili klikom na dugme za konfiguraciju u :guilabel:`Pregledaču oznaka` i biranjem stavke :guilabel:`Prikaži samo knjige koje imaju vidljive kategorije`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:558
msgid "*Search using templates*"
msgstr "*Pretraga pomoću šablona*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:560
msgid ""
"You can search using a template in :ref:`templatelangcalibre` instead of a "
"metadata field. To do so you enter a template, a search type, and the value "
"to search for. The syntax is::"
msgstr "Možete pretraživati pomoću šablona u :ref:`templatelangcalibre` umesto polja metapodataka. Da biste to uradili, unesite šablon, tip pretrage i vrednost koju tražite. Sintaksa je::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:564
msgid ""
"The ``template`` is any valid calibre template language template. The "
"``search type`` must be one of ``t`` (text search), ``d`` (date search), "
"``n`` (numeric search), or ``b`` (set/not set (boolean)). The ``value`` is "
"whatever you want, and can use the :ref:`search kinds <search_kinds>` "
"described above for the various search types. You must quote the entire "
"search string if there are spaces anywhere in it."
msgstr "``template`` je bilo koji važeći šablon jezika šablona calibre. ``search type`` mora biti jedno od ``t`` (tekstualna pretraga), ``d`` (pretraga datuma), ``n`` (numerička pretraga) ili ``b`` (postavljeno/nije postavljeno (logičko)). ``value`` je šta god želite i može koristiti :ref:`vrste pretrage <search_kinds>` opisane iznad za različite tipove pretrage. Morate staviti pod navodnike ceo niz za pretragu ako u njemu ima razmaka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:566
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "Primeri:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:568
msgid ""
"``template:\"program: connected_device_name('main')#@#:t:kindle\"`` -- is "
"true when the ``kindle`` device is connected."
msgstr "``template:\"program: connected_device_name('main')#@#:t:kindle\"`` -- je tačno kada je povezan uređaj ``kindle``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:569
msgid ""
"``template:\"program: select(formats_sizes(), 'EPUB')#@#:n:>1000000\"`` -- "
"finds books with EPUB files larger than 1 MB."
msgstr "``template:\"program: select(formats_sizes(), 'EPUB')#@#:n:>1000000\"`` -- pronalazi knjige sa EPUB datotekama većim od 1 MB."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:570
msgid ""
"``template:\"program: select(formats_modtimes('iso'), "
"'EPUB')#@#:d:>10daysago\"`` -- finds books with EPUB files newer than 10 "
"days ago."
msgstr "``template:\"program: select(formats_modtimes('iso'), 'EPUB')#@#:d:>10daysago\"`` -- pronalazi knjige sa EPUB datotekama novijim od 10 dana."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:571
msgid ""
"``template:\"\"\"program: book_count('tags:^\"' & $series & '\"', 0) != "
"0#@#:n:1\"\"\"`` -- finds all books containing the series name in the tags. "
"This example uses super-quoting because the template uses both single quotes"
" (``'``) and double quotes (``\"``) when constructing the search expression."
msgstr "``template:\"\"\"program: book_count('tags:^\"' & $series & '\"', 0) != 0#@#:n:1\"\"\"`` -- pronalazi sve knjige koje sadrže ime serije u oznakama. Ovaj primer koristi super-citiranje jer šablon koristi i jednostruke (``'``) i dvostruke navodnike (``\"``) prilikom konstruisanja izraza za pretragu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:573
msgid ""
"You can build template search queries easily using the :guilabel:`Advanced "
"search dialog` accessed by clicking the button |sbi|. You can test templates"
" on specific books using the calibre :guilabel:`Template tester`, which can "
"be added to the toolbars or menus via :guilabel:`Preferences->Toolbars & "
"menus`. It can also be assigned a keyboard shortcut via "
":guilabel:`Preferences->Shortcuts`."
msgstr "Možete lako praviti upite za pretragu šablona koristeći :guilabel:`Dijalog za naprednu pretragu` kojem se pristupa klikom na dugme |sbi|. Možete testirati šablone na određenim knjigama koristeći calibre :guilabel:`Provera šablona`, koji se može dodati na trake sa alatkama ili menije preko :guilabel:`Podešavanja → Trake sa alatkama i meniji`. Takođe mu se može dodeliti prečica na tastaturi preko :guilabel:`Podešavanja → Prečice`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:575
msgid "*Advanced search dialog*"
msgstr "*Dijalog za naprednu pretragu*"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:583
msgid ":guilabel:`Advanced search dialog`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Dijalog za naprednu pretragu`"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:588
msgid "Saving searches"
msgstr "Čuvanje pretraga"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:590
msgid ""
"calibre allows you to save a frequently used search under a special name and"
" then reuse that search with a single click. To do this, create your search "
"either by typing it in the Search bar or using the Tag browser. Then type "
"the name you would like to give to the search in the Saved Searches box next"
" to the Search bar. Click the plus icon next to the saved searches box to "
"save the search."
msgstr "calibre vam omogućava da sačuvate često korišćenu pretragu pod posebnim imenom i zatim je ponovo upotrebite jednim klikom. Da biste to uradili, kreirajte svoju pretragu bilo kucanjem u traku za pretragu ili korišćenjem Pregledača oznaka. Zatim ukucajte ime koje želite da date pretrazi u polje Sačuvane pretrage pored trake za pretragu. Kliknite na ikonu plus pored polja za sačuvane pretrage da biste sačuvali pretragu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:592
msgid ""
"Now you can access your saved search in the Tag browser under "
":guilabel:`Saved searches`. A single click will allow you to reuse any "
"arbitrarily complex search easily, without needing to re-create it."
msgstr "Sada možete pristupiti svojoj sačuvanoj pretrazi u Pregledaču oznaka pod :guilabel:`Sačuvane pretrage`. Jedan klik će vam omogućiti da lako ponovo upotrebite bilo koju proizvoljno složenu pretragu, bez potrebe da je ponovo kreirate."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:595
msgid "Searching the full text of all books"
msgstr "Pretraga celog teksta svih knjiga"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:600
msgid ""
"|ftsb| calibre can *optionally* index the full text of books in the library "
"to allow for instant searching of words inside any book. To use this "
"functionality click the :guilabel:`FT` button at the left edge of the search"
" bar."
msgstr "|ftsb| calibre može po želji da indeksira pun tekst knjiga u biblioteci kako bi omogućio trenutnu pretragu reči unutar bilo koje knjige. Da biste koristili ovu funkcionalnost, kliknite na dugme :guilabel:`FT` na levoj ivici trake za pretragu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:597
msgid "ftsb"
msgstr "ftsb"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:604
msgid ""
"Then, enable indexing for the current library. Once indexing is complete you"
" can search all the text in the full library. When you add new books to the "
"library, they will be automatically indexed in the background. This search "
"allows you to quickly find all books that contain a word or combination of "
"words. You can even search for words that occur near other words, as shown "
"in the examples in the search popup window. Note that this search tool will "
"find only one occurrence of the search query in a particular book, not list "
"every occurrence, for that it is best to search inside the book using the "
"calibre :guilabel:`E-book viewer`."
msgstr "Zatim, omogućite indeksiranje za trenutnu biblioteku. Kada se indeksiranje završi, možete pretraživati sav tekst u celoj biblioteci. Kada dodate nove knjige u biblioteku, one će automatski biti indeksirane u pozadini. Ova pretraga vam omogućava da brzo pronađete sve knjige koje sadrže reč ili kombinaciju reči. Možete čak pretraživati reči koje se nalaze blizu drugih reči, kao što je prikazano u primerima u iskačućem prozoru za pretragu. Imajte na umu da će ovaj alat za pretragu pronaći samo jedno pojavljivanje upita za pretragu u određenoj knjizi, a ne izlistati svako pojavljivanje; za to je najbolje pretraživati unutar knjige koristeći calibre :guilabel:`Čitač e-knjiga`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:613
msgid ""
"You can re-index an individual book by right clicking on the :guilabel:`Book"
" details panel` in calibre and choosing :guilabel:`Re-index this book for "
"full text searching`."
msgstr "Možete ponovo indeksirati pojedinačnu knjigu desnim klikom na :guilabel:`Panel sa detaljima o knjizi` u calibre-u i odabirom :guilabel:`Ponovo indeksiraj knjigu za pretragu celog teksta`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:618
msgid "Virtual libraries"
msgstr "Virtuelne biblioteke"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:620
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Virtual library` is a way to pretend that your calibre library "
"has only a few books instead of its full collection. This is an excellent "
"way to partition your large collection of books into smaller, manageable "
"chunks. To learn how to create and use Virtual libraries, see the tutorial: "
":ref:`virtual_libraries`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Virtuelna biblioteka` omogućava da prikažete samo deo knjiga iz svoje calibre biblioteke. Ovo je odličan način da podelite svoju veliku kolekciju knjiga na manje, upravljive delove. Da biste naučili kako da kreirate i koristite virtuelne biblioteke, pogledajte tutorijal: :ref:`virtual_libraries`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:627
msgid "Temporarily marking books"
msgstr "Privremeno označavanje knjiga"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:629
msgid ""
"You can temporarily mark arbitrary sets of books. Marked books will have a "
"pin on them and can be found with the search ``marked:true``. To mark a book"
" press :kbd:`Ctrl+M` or go to :guilabel:`Preferences->Toolbars & menus` and "
"add the :guilabel:`Mark books` button to the main toolbar."
msgstr "Možete privremeno označiti proizvoljne skupove knjiga. Označene knjige biće označene ikonom pribadače i mogu se pronaći pretragom ``marked:true``. Da biste označili knjigu, pritisnite :kbd:`Ctrl+M` ili idite na :guilabel:`Podešavanja → Trake sa alatkama i meniji` i dodajte dugme :guilabel:`Označi knjige` na glavnu traku sa alatkama."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:631
msgid ""
"You can mark books with a specific text label by right clicking the "
":guilabel:`Mark books` button and choosing :guilabel:`Mark books with text "
"label`. Books marked with text labels can later be found using the search "
"``marked:\"=the-text-you-entered\"``."
msgstr "Možete označiti knjige određenom tekstualnom oznakom desnim klikom na dugme :guilabel:`Označi knjige` i odabirom :guilabel:`Označi knjige tekstualnom oznakom`. Knjige označene tekstualnim oznakama mogu se kasnije pronaći koristeći pretragu ``marked:\"=the-text-you-entered\"``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:636
msgid "Guessing metadata from file names"
msgstr "Pogađanje metapodataka iz imena fajlova"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:638
msgid ""
"Normally, calibre reads metadata from inside the book file. However, it can "
"be configured to read metadata from the file name instead, via "
":guilabel:`Preferences->Import/export->Adding books->Read metadata from file"
" contents`."
msgstr "Normalno, calibre čita metapodatke iz samog fajla knjige. Međutim, može se podesiti da umesto toga čita metapodatke iz imena fajla, preko :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Uvoz/izvoz->Dodavanje knjiga->Čitaj metapodatke iz sadržaja fajla`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:642
msgid ""
"You can also control how metadata is read from the filename using regular "
"expressions (see :doc:`regexp`). In the :guilabel:`Adding books` section of "
"the configuration dialog, you can specify a regular expression that calibre "
"will use to try and guess metadata from the names of e-book files that you "
"add to the library. The default regular expression is::"
msgstr "Takođe možete kontrolisati kako se metapodaci čitaju iz imena fajla koristeći regularne izraze (pogledajte :doc:`regexp`). U sekciji :guilabel:`Dodavanje knjiga` u dijalogu za konfiguraciju, možete navesti regularni izraz koji će calibre koristiti da pokuša da pogodi metapodatke iz imena fajlova e-knjiga koje dodajete u biblioteku. Podrazumevani regularni izraz je::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:650
msgid ""
"that is, it assumes that all characters up to the first ``-`` are the title "
"of the book and subsequent characters are the author of the book. For "
"example, the filename::"
msgstr "to jest, pretpostavlja da su svi karakteri do prvog ``-`` naslov knjige, a naredni karakteri autor knjige. Na primer, ime fajla::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:656
msgid ""
"will be interpreted to have the title: Foundation and Earth and author: "
"Isaac Asimov"
msgstr "biće protumačeno tako da ima naslov: Foundation and Earth i autora: Isaac Asimov"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:659
msgid ""
"If the filename does not contain the hyphen, the above regular expression "
"will fail."
msgstr "Ako ime fajla ne sadrži crticu, gornji regularni izraz neće uspeti."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:665
msgid "Book details"
msgstr "Detalji o knjizi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:669
msgid ""
"The Book details display shows the cover and all the metadata for the "
"currently selected book. It can be hidden via the :guilabel:`Layout` button "
"in the lower right corner of the main calibre window. The author names shown"
" in the Book details panel are click-able, they will by default take you to "
"the Wikipedia page for the author.  This can be customized by right clicking"
" on the author name and selecting Manage this author."
msgstr "Prikaz detalja o knjizi prikazuje korice i sve metapodatke za trenutno izabranu knjigu. Može se sakriti preko dugmeta :guilabel:`Raspored` u donjem desnom uglu glavnog calibre prozora. Imena autora prikazana u panelu sa detaljima o knjizi se mogu kliknuti, podrazumevano će vas odvesti na Wikipedia stranicu za autora. Ovo se može prilagoditi desnim klikom na ime autora i izborom Upravljaj ovim autorom."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:676
msgid ""
"Similarly, if you download metadata for the book, the Book details panel "
"will automatically show you links pointing to the web pages for the book on "
"Amazon, WorldCat, etc. from where the metadata was downloaded."
msgstr "Slično tome, ako preuzmete metapodatke za knjigu, panel sa detaljima o knjizi će vam automatski prikazati linkove koji vode do veb stranica za knjigu na Amazonu, WorldCat-u, itd. odakle su metapodaci preuzeti."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:680
msgid ""
"You can right click on individual e-book formats in the Book details panel "
"to delete them, compare them to their original versions, save them to disk, "
"open them with an external program, etc."
msgstr "Možete kliknuti desnim tasterom miša na pojedinačne formate e-knjiga u panelu sa detaljima o knjizi da biste ih izbrisali, uporedili sa njihovim originalnim verzijama, sačuvali na disk, otvorili u eksternom programu itd."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:684
msgid ""
"You can change the cover of the book by simply drag and dropping an image "
"onto the Book details panel. If you wish to edit the cover image in an "
"external program, simply right click on it and choose :guilabel:`Open with`."
msgstr "Možete promeniti korice knjige jednostavnim prevlačenjem i puštanjem slike na panel sa detaljima o knjizi. Ako želite da uredite sliku korica u eksternom programu, jednostavno kliknite desnim tasterom miša na nju i izaberite :guilabel:`Otvori pomoću`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:688
msgid ""
"You can also add e-book files to the current book by drag and dropping the "
"files onto the Book details panel."
msgstr "Takođe možete dodati fajlove e-knjiga trenutnoj knjizi prevlačenjem i puštanjem fajlova na panel sa detaljima o knjizi."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:691
msgid ""
"Double clicking the Book details panel will open it up in a separate popup "
"window."
msgstr "Dvostruki klik na panel sa detaljima o knjizi otvoriće ga u zasebnom iskačućem prozoru."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:694
msgid ""
"Finally, you can customize exactly what information is displayed in the Book"
" details panel via :guilabel:`Preferences->Interface->Look & feel->Book "
"details`."
msgstr "Na kraju, možete tačno prilagoditi koje informacije se prikazuju u panelu sa detaljima o knjizi preko :guilabel:`Podešavanja → Interfejs → Izgled → Detalji o knjizi`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:704
msgid "Tag browser"
msgstr "Pregledač oznaka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:708
msgid ""
"The Tag browser allows you to easily browse your collection by "
"Author/Tags/Series/etc. If you click on any item in the Tag browser, for "
"example the author name Isaac Asimov, then the list of books to the right is"
" restricted to showing books by that author. You can click on category names"
" as well. For example, clicking on \"Series\" will show you all books in any"
" series."
msgstr "Pregledač oznaka vam omogućava da lako pregledate svoju kolekciju po autoru/oznakama/serijalima/itd. Ako kliknete na bilo koju stavku u pregledaču oznaka, na primer ime autora Isaac Asimov, onda je lista knjiga sa desne strane ograničena na prikazivanje knjiga tog autora. Možete kliknuti i na imena kategorija. Na primer, klikom na \"Series\" prikazaće se sve knjige u bilo kom serijalu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:710
msgid ""
"The first click on an item will restrict the list of books to those that "
"contain or match the item. Continuing the above example, clicking on Isaac "
"Asimov will show books by that author. Clicking again on the item will "
"change what is shown, depending on whether the item has children (see sub-"
"categories and hierarchical items below). Continuing the Isaac Asimov "
"example, clicking again on Isaac Asimov will restrict the list of books to "
"those not by Isaac Asimov. A third click will remove the restriction, "
"showing all books. If you hold down the :kbd:`Ctrl` or :kbd:`Shift` keys and"
" click on multiple items, then restrictions based on multiple items are "
"created. For example you could hold :kbd:`Ctrl` and click on the tags "
"History and Europe for finding books on European history. The Tag browser "
"works by constructing search expressions that are automatically entered into"
" the Search bar. Looking at what the Tag browser generates is a good way to "
"learn how to construct basic search expressions."
msgstr "Prvi klik na stavku će ograničiti listu knjiga na one koje sadrže ili se podudaraju sa stavkom. Nastavljajući gornji primer, klik na Isaac Asimov će prikazati knjige tog autora. Ponovni klik na stavku će promeniti ono što je prikazano, u zavisnosti od toga da li stavka ima podređene elemente (pogledajte potkategorije i hijerarhijske stavke ispod). Nastavljajući primer sa Isaac Asimov, ponovni klik na Isaac Asimov će ograničiti listu knjiga na one koje nije napisao Isaac Asimov. Treći klik će ukloniti ograničenje, prikazujući sve knjige. Ako držite pritisnute tastere :kbd:`Ctrl` ili :kbd:`Shift` i kliknete na više stavki, onda se kreiraju ograničenja na osnovu više stavki. Na primer, mogli biste da držite :kbd:`Ctrl` i kliknete na oznake History i Europe da biste pronašli knjige o evropskoj istoriji. Pregledač oznaka funkcioniše tako što konstruiše izraze za pretragu koji se automatski unose u traku za pretragu. Gledanje onoga što pregledač oznaka generiše je dobar način da naučite kako da konstruišete osnovne izraze za pretragu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:712
msgid ""
"Items in the Tag browser have their icons partially colored. The amount of "
"color depends on the average rating of the books in that category. So for "
"example if the books by Isaac Asimov have an average of four stars, the icon"
" for Isaac Asimov in the Tag browser will be 4/5th colored. You can hover "
"your mouse over the icon to see the average rating."
msgstr "Stavke u pregledaču oznaka imaju delimično obojene ikone. Količina boje zavisi od prosečne ocene knjiga u toj kategoriji. Tako na primer, ako knjige autora Isaac Asimov imaju prosek od četiri zvezdice, ikona za Isaac Asimov u pregledaču oznaka biće obojena 4/5. Možete preći mišem preko ikone da biste videli prosečnu ocenu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:714
msgid ""
"The outer-level items in the :guilabel:`Tag browser`, such as Authors and "
"Series, are called categories. You can create your own categories, called "
":guilabel:`User categories`, which are useful for organizing items. For "
"example, you can use the :guilabel:`User categories editor` (click the "
":guilabel:`Configure` button at the lower-left of the :guilabel:`Tag "
"browser` and choose :guilabel:`Manage authors, tags, etc->User categories`) "
"to create a User category called ``Favorite Authors``, then put the items "
"for your favorites into the category. User categories can have sub-"
"categories. For example, the User category ``Favorites.Authors`` is a sub-"
"category of ``Favorites``. You might also have ``Favorites.Series``, in "
"which case there will be two sub-categories under ``Favorites``. Sub-"
"categories can be created by right-clicking on a User category, choosing "
":guilabel:`Add sub-category to...`, and entering the sub-category name; or "
"by using the :guilabel:`User categories editor` by entering names like the "
"Favorites example above."
msgstr "Stavke spoljnog nivoa u :guilabel:`Pregledač oznaka`-u, kao što su Autori i Serije, nazivaju se kategorije. Možete kreirati sopstvene kategorije, nazvane :guilabel:`Korisničke kategorije`, koje su korisne za organizovanje stavki. Na primer, možete koristiti :guilabel:`Uređivač korisničkih kategorija` (kliknite na dugme :guilabel:`Podesi` u donjem levom uglu :guilabel:`Pregledač oznaka`-a i izaberite :guilabel:`Upravljaj autorima, oznakama itd. → Korisničke kategorije`) da kreirate korisničku kategoriju pod nazivom ``Favorite Authors``, a zatim stavite stavke za vaše omiljene u tu kategoriju. Korisničke kategorije mogu imati potkategorije. Na primer, korisnička kategorija ``Favorites.Authors`` je potkategorija od ``Favorites``. Takođe možete imati ``Favorites.Series``, u kom slučaju će postojati dve potkategorije pod ``Favorites``. Potkategorije se mogu kreirati desnim klikom na korisničku kategoriju, biranjem :guilabel:`Dodaj potkategoriju u...` i unosom imena potkategorije; ili korišćenjem :guilabel:`Uređivač korisničkih kategorija`-a unosom imena kao u primeru Favorites iznad."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:716
msgid ""
"You can search User categories in the same way as built-in categories, by "
"clicking on them. There are four different searches cycled through by "
"clicking:"
msgstr "Možete pretraživati korisničke kategorije na isti način kao i ugrađene kategorije, klikom na njih. Postoje četiri različite pretrage koje se smenjuju klikom:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:717
msgid ""
"\"everything matching an item in the category\" indicated by a single green "
"plus sign."
msgstr "\"sve što se podudara sa stavkom u kategoriji\" označeno jednim zelenim znakom plus."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:718
msgid ""
"\"everything matching an item in the category or its sub-categories\" "
"indicated by two green plus signs."
msgstr "\"sve što se podudara sa stavkom u kategoriji ili njenim potkategorijama\" označeno sa dva zelena znaka plus."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:719
msgid ""
"\"everything not matching an item in the category\" shown by a single red "
"minus sign."
msgstr "\"sve što se ne podudara sa stavkom u kategoriji\" prikazano jednim crvenim znakom minus."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:720
msgid ""
"\"everything not matching an item in the category or its sub-categories\" "
"shown by two red minus signs."
msgstr "\"sve što se ne podudara sa stavkom u kategoriji ili njenim potkategorijama\" prikazano sa dva crvena znaka minus."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:722
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create hierarchies inside some of the text categories"
" such as tags, series, and custom columns. These hierarchies show with the "
"small triangle, permitting the sub-items to be hidden. To use hierarchies of"
" items in a category, you must first go to "
":guilabel:`Preferences->Interface->Look & feel` and enter the category "
"name(s) into the \"Categories with hierarchical items\" field. Once this is "
"done, items in that category that contain periods will be shown using the "
"small triangle. For example, assume you create a custom column called "
"\"Genre\" and indicate that it contains hierarchical items. Once done, items"
" such as Mystery.Thriller and Mystery.English will display as Mystery with "
"the small triangle next to it. Clicking on the triangle will show Thriller "
"and English as sub-items. See :ref:`Managing subgroups of books, for example"
" \"genre\" <subgroups-tutorial>` for more information."
msgstr "Takođe je moguće kreirati hijerarhije unutar nekih tekstualnih kategorija kao što su oznake, serije i prilagođene kolone. Ove hijerarhije se prikazuju sa malim trouglom, omogućavajući da se podstavke sakriju. Da biste koristili hijerarhije stavki u kategoriji, prvo morate otići na :guilabel:`Podešavanja → Interfejs → Izgled` i uneti ime(na) kategorije u polje \"Categories with hierarchical items\". Kada se to uradi, stavke u toj kategoriji koje sadrže tačke biće prikazane pomoću malog trougla. Na primer, pretpostavimo da kreirate prilagođenu kolonu pod nazivom \"Genre\" i naznačite da sadrži hijerarhijske stavke. Kada to završite, stavke kao što su Mystery.Thriller i Mystery.English će se prikazati kao Mystery sa malim trouglom pored. Klikom na trougao prikazaće se Thriller i English kao podstavke. Pogledajte :ref:`Managing subgroups of books, for example \"genre\" <subgroups-tutorial>` za više informacija."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:724
msgid ""
"Hierarchical items (items with children) use the same four 'click-on' "
"searches as User categories. Items that do not have children use two of the "
"searches: \"everything matching\" and \"everything not matching\"."
msgstr "Hijerarhijske stavke (stavke sa podređenim elementima) koriste iste četiri pretrage na klik kao i korisničke kategorije. Stavke koje nemaju podređene elemente koriste dve pretrage: \"sve što se podudara\" i \"sve što se ne podudara\"."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:726
msgid ""
"You can drag and drop items in the Tag browser onto User categories to add "
"them to that category. If the source is a User category, holding the "
":kbd:`Shift` key while dragging will move the item to the new category. You "
"can also drag and drop books from the book list onto items in the Tag "
"browser; dropping a book on an item causes that item to be automatically "
"applied to the dropped books. For example, dragging a book onto Isaac Asimov"
" will set the author of that book to Isaac Asimov. Dropping it onto the tag "
"History will add the tag History to the book's tags."
msgstr "Možete da prevlačite i puštate stavke u Pregledaču oznaka na Korisničke kategorije da biste ih dodali u tu kategoriju. Ako je izvor Korisnička kategorija, držanje tastera :kbd:`Shift` tokom prevlačenja će premestiti stavku u novu kategoriju. Takođe možete prevlačiti i puštati knjige sa liste knjiga na stavke u Pregledaču oznaka; puštanje knjige na stavku uzrokuje da se ta stavka automatski primeni na puštene knjige. Na primer, prevlačenje knjige na Isaac Asimov će postaviti autora te knjige na Isaac Asimov. Puštanje na oznaku History će dodati oznaku History u oznake knjige."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:728
msgid ""
"You can easily find any item in the Tag browser by clicking the search "
"button at the lower-right corner. In addition, you can right click on any "
"item and choose one of several operations. Some examples are to hide it, "
"rename it, or open a \"Manage x\" dialog that allows you to manage items of "
"that kind. For example, the :guilabel:`Manage authors` dialog allows you to "
"rename authors and control how their names are sorted."
msgstr "Možete lako pronaći bilo koju stavku u Pregledaču oznaka klikom na dugme za pretragu u donjem desnom uglu. Pored toga, možete kliknuti desnim tasterom miša na bilo koju stavku i izabrati jednu od nekoliko operacija. Neki primeri su sakrivanje, preimenovanje ili otvaranje dijaloga \"Upravljaj x\" koji vam omogućava da upravljate stavkama te vrste. Na primer, dijalog :guilabel:`Upravljaj autorima` vam omogućava da preimenujete autore i kontrolišete kako se njihova imena sortiraju."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:730
msgid ""
"You can control how items are sorted in the Tag browser via the "
":guilabel:`Configure` button at the lower-left of the Tag browser. You can "
"choose to sort by name, average rating or popularity (popularity is the "
"number of books with an item in your library; for example, the popularity of"
" Isaac Asimov is the number of books in your library by Isaac Asimov)."
msgstr "Možete kontrolisati kako se stavke sortiraju u Pregledaču oznaka preko dugmeta :guilabel:`Podesi` u donjem levom uglu Pregledača oznaka. Možete izabrati sortiranje po imenu, prosečnoj oceni ili popularnosti (popularnost je broj knjiga sa stavkom u vašoj biblioteci; na primer, popularnost Isaac Asimov je broj knjiga u vašoj biblioteci od Isaac Asimov)."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:732
msgid ""
"You can use your own icons for categories and values in categories. To "
"change the icon for a category, right-click on the category (the outer-level"
" item) and choose `Change (category name) category icon`. A dialog will open"
" where you can pick an image to be used as the icon. To restore the icon to "
"its default choose `Restore (category name) default icon`."
msgstr "Možete koristiti sopstvene ikone za kategorije i vrednosti u kategorijama. Da biste promenili ikonu za kategoriju, kliknite desnim tasterom miša na kategoriju (stavka spoljnog nivoa) i izaberite `Promeni ikonu kategorije (ime kategorije)`. Otvoriće se dijalog u kojem možete izabrati sliku koja će se koristiti kao ikona. Da biste vratili ikonu na podrazumevanu, izaberite `Vrati podrazumevanu ikonu (ime kategorije)`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:735
msgid ""
"To choose icons for values in categories, right-click on a value then choose"
" `Manage icon for (value name)`. You will see a list of choices:"
msgstr "Da biste izabrali ikone za vrednosti u kategorijama, kliknite desnim tasterom miša na vrednost, a zatim izaberite `Upravljaj ikonom za (ime vrednosti)`. Videćete listu izbora:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:737
msgid ""
"`Choose an icon for this value but not its children`. A dialog will open "
"where you choose an icon for the value. Children of that value will not "
"inherit that icon."
msgstr "`Izaberi ikonu za ovu vrednost, ali ne i za njenu decu`. Otvoriće se dijalog u kojem birate ikonu za vrednost. Deca te vrednosti neće naslediti tu ikonu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:738
msgid ""
"`Choose an icon for this value and its children`. A dialog will open where "
"you choose an icon for the value. Any children that don't have their own "
"specified icon will inherit this icon."
msgstr "`Izaberi ikonu za ovu vrednost i njenu decu`. Otvoriće se dijalog u kojem birate ikonu za vrednost. Sva deca koja nemaju svoju navedenu ikonu će naslediti ovu ikonu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:739
msgid ""
"`Use the existing icon for this value but not its children`. This option is "
"offered if the value already has an icon that is inherited by the value's "
"children. Selecting it will make the icon apply to the value but not its "
"children."
msgstr "`Koristi postojeću ikonu za ovu vrednost, ali ne i za njenu decu`. Ova opcija se nudi ako vrednost već ima ikonu koju nasleđuju deca vrednosti. Njenim izborom ikona će se primeniti na vrednost, ali ne i na njenu decu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:740
msgid ""
"`Use the existing icon for this value and its children`. This option is "
"offered if the value already has an icon that is not inherited by the "
"value's children. Selecting it will make the icon apply to the value and its"
" children."
msgstr "`Koristi postojeću ikonu za ovu vrednost i njenu decu`. Ova opcija se nudi ako vrednost već ima ikonu koju ne nasleđuju deca te vrednosti. Njenim izborom ikona će se primeniti na vrednost i njenu decu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:741
msgid ""
"`Use the default icon for this value`. This option is offered if the item "
"has an icon. It removes the icon from the value and any children inheriting "
"the icon. The default icon is what is specified below."
msgstr "`Koristi podrazumevanu ikonu za ovu vrednost`. Ova opcija se nudi ako stavka ima ikonu. Ona uklanja ikonu sa vrednosti i sve dece koja nasleđuju ikonu. Podrazumevana ikona je ono što je navedeno ispod."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:742
msgid ""
"`Reset all value icons to the default icon`. This option removes all item "
"value icons for the category. It does not remove a template if one exists. "
"There is no undo."
msgstr "`Resetuj sve ikone vrednosti na podrazumevanu ikonu`. Ova opcija uklanja sve ikone vrednosti stavki za kategoriju. Ne uklanja šablon ako on postoji. Nema opoziva."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:743
msgid ""
"`Use/edit a template to choose the default value icon`. This option permits "
"you to provide a calibre template that returns the name of an icon file to "
"be used as a default icon. The template can use the following variables:"
msgstr "`Koristi/uredi šablon za izbor podrazumevane ikone vrednosti`. Ova opcija vam omogućava da obezbedite calibre šablon koji vraća ime datoteke ikone koja će se koristiti kao podrazumevana ikona. Šablon može koristiti sledeće promenljive:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:745
msgid ""
"``category``: the lookup name of the category, for example ``authors``, "
"``series``, ``#mycolumn``."
msgstr "``category``: ime pretrage kategorije, na primer ``authors``, ``series``, ``#mycolumn``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:746
msgid "``value``: the value of the item within the category."
msgstr "``value``: vrednost stavke unutar kategorije."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:747
msgid ""
"``count``: the number of books with this value. If the value is part of a "
"hierarchy then the count includes the children."
msgstr "``count``: broj knjiga sa ovom vrednošću. Ako je vrednost deo hijerarhije, onda broj uključuje i decu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:748
msgid ""
"``avg_rating``: the average rating for books with this value. If the value "
"is part of a hierarchy then the average includes the children."
msgstr "``avg_rating``: prosečna ocena za knjige sa ovom vrednošću. Ako je vrednost deo hijerarhije, onda prosek uključuje i decu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:750
msgid ""
"Book metadata such as title is not available. Template database functions "
"such as :ref:`ff_book_count` and :ref:`ff_book_values` will work, but the "
"performance might not be acceptable. The following template functions will "
"work in the GUI but won't work in the content server: "
":ref:`ff_connected_device_name`, :ref:`ff_connected_device_uuid`, "
":ref:`ff_current_virtual_library_name`, :ref:`ff_is_marked`, and "
":ref:`ff_virtual_libraries`."
msgstr "Metapodaci knjige kao što je naslov nisu dostupni. Funkcije baze podataka šablona kao što su :ref:`ff_book_count` i :ref:`ff_book_values` će raditi, ali performanse možda neće biti prihvatljive. Sledeće funkcije šablona će raditi u GUI-ju, ali neće raditi na serveru sadržaja: :ref:`ff_connected_device_name`, :ref:`ff_connected_device_uuid`, :ref:`ff_current_virtual_library_name`, :ref:`ff_is_marked` i :ref:`ff_virtual_libraries`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:752
msgid ""
"In the GUI, Python templates have full access to the calibre database. In "
"the content server, Python templates have access to new API (see `API "
"documentation for the database interface <https://manual.calibre-"
"ebook.com/db_api.html>`_) but not the old API (LibraryDatabase)."
msgstr "U GUI-ju, Python šabloni imaju pun pristup calibre bazi podataka. Na serveru sadržaja, Python šabloni imaju pristup novom API-ju (pogledajte `API dokumentaciju za interfejs baze podataka <https://manual.calibre-ebook.com/db_api.html>`_), ali ne i starom API-ju (LibraryDatabase)."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:754
msgid ""
"For example, this template specifies that any value in the clicked-on "
"category beginning with `History` will have an icon named ``flower.png``::"
msgstr "Na primer, ovaj šablon određuje da će svaka vrednost u kliknutoj kategoriji koja počinje sa `History` imati ikonu pod nazivom ``flower.png``::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:759
msgid ""
"If a template returns the empty string (``''``) then the category icon will "
"be used. If the template returns a file name that doesn't exist then no icon"
" is displayed."
msgstr "Ako šablon vrati prazan string (``''``), onda će se koristiti ikona kategorije. Ako šablon vrati ime datoteke koja ne postoji, ikona se neće prikazati."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:762
msgid ""
"`Use the category icon as the default`. This option specifies that the icon "
"used for the category should be used for any value that doesn't otherwise "
"have an icon. Selecting this option removes any template icon specification."
msgstr "`Koristi ikonu kategorije kao podrazumevanu`. Ova opcija određuje da ikona koja se koristi za kategoriju treba da se koristi za svaku vrednost koja inače nema ikonu. Izborom ove opcije uklanja se svaka specifikacija ikone šablona."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:765
msgid "The icon is chosen using the following hierarchy:"
msgstr "Ikona se bira koristeći sledeću hijerarhiju:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:767
msgid "The icon specified for the value, if it exists."
msgstr "Ikona navedena za vrednost, ako postoji."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:768
msgid ""
"The icon specified for a parent node found by walking up the tree, if one "
"exists."
msgstr "Ikona navedena za roditeljski čvor pronađena penjanjem uz stablo, ako postoji."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:769
msgid ""
"The icon from a template, if a template exists and it returns a non-empty "
"string."
msgstr "Ikona iz šablona, ako šablon postoji i vraća neprazan string."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:770
msgid "The default category icon, which always exists."
msgstr "Podrazumevana ikona kategorije, koja uvek postoji."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:772
msgid ""
"Icons are per-user, not per-library, stored in the calibre configuration "
"folder. Icons for item values are stored in the :file:`tb_icons` subfolder. "
"Icons used by templates are in the :file:`template_icons` subfolder of "
":file:`tb_icons`."
msgstr "Ikone su po korisniku, a ne po biblioteci, i čuvaju se u fascikli za konfiguraciju calibre-a. Ikone za vrednosti stavki se čuvaju u podfascikli :file:`tb_icons`. Ikone koje koriste šabloni nalaze se u podfascikli :file:`template_icons` unutar :file:`tb_icons`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:780
msgid "Cover grid"
msgstr "Mreža korica"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:785
msgid ""
"You can have calibre display a grid of book covers instead of a list of "
"books, if you prefer to browse your collection by covers instead. The "
":guilabel:`Cover grid` is activated by clicking the :guilabel:`Layout` "
"button in the bottom right corner of the main calibre window. You can "
"customize the cover sizes and the background of the :guilabel:`Cover grid` "
"via :guilabel:`Preferences->Interface->Look & feel->Cover grid`. You can "
"even have calibre display any specified field under the covers, such as "
"title or authors or rating or a custom column of your own devising."
msgstr "Možete podesiti da calibre prikazuje mrežu korica knjiga umesto liste knjiga, ako više volite da pregledate svoju kolekciju po koricama. :guilabel:`Mreža korica` se aktivira klikom na dugme :guilabel:`Raspored` u donjem desnom uglu glavnog prozora calibre-a. Možete prilagoditi veličine korica i pozadinu :guilabel:`Mreže korica` preko :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Interfejs->Izgled i osećaj->Mreža korica`. Možete čak podesiti da calibre prikazuje bilo koje navedeno polje ispod korica, kao što su naslov, autori, ocena ili prilagođena kolona koju ste sami osmislili."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:796
msgid "Bookshelf view"
msgstr "Prikaz police za knjige"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:801
msgid ""
"You can have calibre display your book collection in shelves, optionally "
"grouped by authors/date/rating etc. The :guilabel:`Bookshelf view` is "
"activated by clicking the :guilabel:`Layout` button in the bottom right "
"corner of the main calibre window. You can customize everything about the "
"view from the background, to the text on the spines, the fonts, et cetera "
"via :guilabel:`Preferences->Interface->Look & feel->Bookshelf`."
msgstr "Možete podesiti da calibre prikazuje vašu kolekciju knjiga na policama, po želji grupisanu po autorima/datumu/oceni itd. :guilabel:`Prikaz police za knjige` se aktivira klikom na dugme :guilabel:`Raspored` u donjem desnom uglu glavnog prozora calibre-a. Možete prilagoditi sve u vezi sa prikazom, od pozadine, do teksta na hrbatima, fontova, itd. preko :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Interfejs->Izgled i osećaj->Polica za knjige`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:810
msgid "Cover browser"
msgstr "Pregledač naslovnih strana"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:815
msgid ""
"In addition to the :guilabel:`Cover grid` described above, you can also have"
" calibre display covers in a single row. This is activated via the "
":guilabel:`Layout` button in the lower right corner of the main window. In "
":guilabel:`Preferences->Interface->Look & feel->Cover browser` you can "
"change the number of covers displayed, and even have the :guilabel:`Cover "
"browser` display itself in a separate popup window."
msgstr "Pored :guilabel:`Mreže korica` opisane iznad, možete takođe podesiti da calibre prikazuje korice u jednom redu. Ovo se aktivira preko dugmeta :guilabel:`Raspored` u donjem desnom uglu glavnog prozora. U :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Interfejs->Izgled i osećaj->Pregledač korica` možete promeniti broj prikazanih korica, pa čak i podesiti da se :guilabel:`Pregledač korica` prikazuje u zasebnom iskačućem prozoru."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:822
msgid "Adding notes for authors, series, etc."
msgstr "Dodavanje beleški za autore, serije, itd."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:827
msgid ""
"You can add notes for an author/series/tag/publisher/etc. to your calibre "
"library. To do so right click on the author name in the :guilabel:`Tag "
"browser` on the left or the :guilabel:`Book details` panel on the right and "
"choose :guilabel:`Create note` or :guilabel:`Edit note`."
msgstr "Možete dodati beleške za autora/seriju/oznaku/izdavača/itd. u vašu calibre biblioteku. Da biste to uradili, kliknite desnim tasterom miša na ime autora u :guilabel:`Pregledaču oznaka` sa leve strane ili na panelu :guilabel:`Detalji o knjizi` sa desne strane i izaberite :guilabel:`Kreiraj belešku` ili :guilabel:`Uredi belešku`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:832
msgid ""
"A simple popup window will allow you to enter your notes using basic "
"formatting and supporting links and images. Once a note for an author is "
"created, it can be viewed easily from the :guilabel:`Book details` panel by "
"clicking the little pencil icon next to the author name."
msgstr "Jednostavan iskačući prozor će vam omogućiti da unesete svoje beleške koristeći osnovno formatiranje i podržavajući veze i slike. Kada se kreira beleška za autora, može se lako pregledati iz panela :guilabel:`Detalji o knjizi` klikom na malu ikonu olovke pored imena autora."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:837
msgid ""
"You can search through all the notes in your library using the "
":guilabel:`Browse notes` tool by pressing :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+N` or adding it "
"to the toolbar via :guilabel:`Preferences->Toolbars & menus`."
msgstr "Možete pretraživati sve beleške u vašoj biblioteci koristeći alatku :guilabel:`Pregledaj beleške` pritiskom na :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+N` ili dodavanjem na traku sa alatkama preko :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Trake sa alatkama i meniji`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:847
msgid "Quickview"
msgstr "Brzi prikaz"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:849
msgid ""
"Sometimes you want to select a book and quickly get a list of books with the"
" same value in some category (authors, tags, publisher, series, etc.) as the"
" currently selected book, but without changing the current view of the "
"library. You can do this with Quickview. Quickview opens either a second "
"window or a panel in the book list showing the list of books matching the "
"value of interest. For example, assume you want to see a list of all the "
"books with one or more of the authors of the currently-selected book. Click "
"in the author cell you are interested in and press the 'Q' key or click the "
":guilabel:`Quickview` icon in the :guilabel:`Layout` section of the calibre "
"window. A window or panel will open with all the authors for that book on "
"the left, and all the books by the selected author on the right."
msgstr "Ponekad želite da izaberete knjigu i brzo dobijete listu knjiga sa istom vrednošću u nekoj kategoriji (autori, oznake, izdavač, serija, itd.) kao trenutno izabrana knjiga, ali bez promene trenutnog prikaza biblioteke. To možete uraditi pomoću Brzog prikaza. Brzi prikaz otvara ili drugi prozor ili panel u listi knjiga koji prikazuje listu knjiga koje odgovaraju vrednosti od interesa. Na primer, pretpostavimo da želite da vidite listu svih knjiga sa jednim ili više autora trenutno izabrane knjige. Kliknite u ćeliju autora koja vas zanima i pritisnite taster 'Q' ili kliknite na ikonu :guilabel:`Brzi prikaz` u odeljku :guilabel:`Raspored` prozora calibre. Otvoriće se prozor ili panel sa svim autorima za tu knjigu sa leve strane, i svim knjigama izabranog autora sa desne strane."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:851
msgid "Some example Quickview usages: quickly seeing what other books:"
msgstr "Primeri upotrebe Brzog prikaza: brzo proverite koje druge knjige:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:852
msgid "have some tag(s) applied to the currently selected book,"
msgstr "imaju neku oznaku(e) primenjenu na trenutno izabranu knjigu,"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:853
msgid "are in the same series as the current book"
msgstr "su u istoj seriji kao trenutna knjiga"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:854
msgid "have the same values in a custom column as the current book"
msgstr "imaju iste vrednosti u prilagođenoj koloni kao trenutna knjiga"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:855
msgid "are written by one of the same authors of the current book"
msgstr "su napisane od strane jednog od istih autora trenutne knjige"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:856
msgid "share values in a custom column"
msgstr "deli vrednosti u prilagođenoj koloni"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:858
msgid "There are two choices for where the Quickview information appears:"
msgstr "Informacije Brzog prikaza mogu se prikazati na dva mesta:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:860
msgid ""
"It can open \"undocked\": on top of the calibre window and will stay open "
"until you explicitly close it."
msgstr "Može se otvoriti \"otkačeno\": preko calibre prozora i ostaće otvoreno dok ga sami ne zatvorite."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:861
msgid ""
"It can open \"docked\": as a panel in the book list section of the calibre "
"main window."
msgstr "Može se otvoriti \"zakačeno\": kao panel u delu liste knjiga glavnog calibre prozora."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:863
msgid ""
"You can move the window from docked to undocked as desired using the "
"\"Dock/Undock\" button."
msgstr "Možete premeštati prozor iz zakačenog u otkačeno stanje po želji koristeći dugme \"Zakači/Otkači\"."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:865
msgid ""
"The Quickview panel can be left open permanently, in which case it follows "
"movements on the book list. For example, if you click in the calibre library"
" view on a category column (tags, series, publisher, authors, etc.) for a "
"book, the Quickview window contents will change to show you in the left-hand"
" side panel the values in that category for the selected book (e.g., the "
"tags for that book). The first item in that list will be selected, and "
"Quickview will show you on the right-hand side panel all the books in your "
"library that use that value. Click on a different value in the left-hand "
"panel to see the books with that different value."
msgstr "Panel Brzog prikaza može ostati trajno otvoren, u kom slučaju prati pomeranja na listi knjiga. Na primer, ako kliknete u prikazu calibre biblioteke na kolonu kategorije (oznake, serije, izdavač, autori, itd.) za neku knjigu, sadržaj prozora Brzog prikaza će se promeniti da vam u levom panelu prikaže vrednosti u toj kategoriji za izabranu knjigu (npr. oznake za tu knjigu). Prva stavka na toj listi će biti izabrana, a Brzi prikaz će vam u desnom panelu prikazati sve knjige u vašoj biblioteci koje koriste tu vrednost. Kliknite na drugu vrednost u levom panelu da vidite knjige sa tom drugom vrednošću."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:867
msgid ""
"Double-click on a book in the Quickview window to select that book in the "
"library view. This will also change the items display in the QuickView "
"window (the left-hand panel) to show the items in the newly-selected book."
msgstr "Dvaput kliknite na knjigu u prozoru Brzog prikaza da izaberete tu knjigu u prikazu biblioteke. Ovo će takođe promeniti prikaz stavki u prozoru Brzog prikaza (levi panel) da prikaže stavke u novoizabranoj knjizi."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:869
msgid ""
":kbd:`Shift-` or :kbd:`Ctrl-` double-click on a book in the Quickview window"
" to open the edit metadata dialog on that book in the calibre window. The "
"edited book will be Quickview'ed when you close the edit metadata dialog."
msgstr ":kbd:`Shift-` ili :kbd:`Ctrl-` dvostruki klik na knjigu u prozoru Brzog prikaza otvara dijalog za uređivanje metapodataka za tu knjigu u calibre prozoru. Uređena knjiga će biti prikazana u Brzom prikazu kada zatvorite dijalog za uređivanje metapodataka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:871
msgid ""
"You can see if a column can be Quickview'ed by hovering your mouse over the "
"column heading and looking at the tooltip for that heading. You can also "
"know by right-clicking on the column heading to see if the \"Quickview\" "
"option is shown in the menu, in which case choosing that Quickview option is"
" equivalent to pressing 'Q' in the current cell."
msgstr "Možete videti da li kolona može biti prikazana u Brzom prikazu tako što ćete preći mišem preko naslova kolone i pogledati opis alatke za taj naslov. Takođe možete znati tako što ćete kliknuti desnim tasterom miša na naslov kolone da vidite da li je opcija \"Brzi prikaz\" prikazana u meniju, u kom slučaju je biranje te opcije Brzog prikaza ekvivalentno pritiskanju 'Q' u trenutnoj ćeliji."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:873
msgid "Options (in :guilabel:`Preferences->Look & feel->Quickview`):"
msgstr "Opcije (u :guilabel:`Podešavanja->Izgled i osećaj->Brzi prikaz`):"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:875
msgid ""
"Respect (or not) the current Virtual library. If checked then Quickview "
"shows only books in the current Virtual library. Default: respect Virtual "
"libraries"
msgstr "Poštuj (ili ne) trenutnu Virtuelnu biblioteku. Ako je označeno, Brzi prikaz prikazuje samo knjige u trenutnoj Virtuelnoj biblioteci. Podrazumevano: poštuj Virtuelne biblioteke"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:876
msgid ""
"Change the Quickview window contents when the column is changed on the book "
"list using the cursor keys. Default: don't follow changes made with cursor "
"keys"
msgstr "Promeni sadržaj prozora Brzog prikaza kada se kolona promeni na listi knjiga pomoću tastera sa strelicama. Podrazumevano: ne prati promene napravljene tasterima sa strelicama"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:877
msgid ""
"Change the column being \"quickview'ed\" when a cell in the Quickview window"
" is double-clicked. Otherwise the book is changed but the column being "
"examined is not. Default: change the column"
msgstr "Promeni kolonu koja se \"brzo pregleda\" kada se dvaput klikne na ćeliju u prozoru Brzog prikaza. U suprotnom se knjiga menja, ali kolona koja se ispituje ne. Podrazumevano: promeni kolonu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:878
msgid ""
"Change the column being \"quickview'ed\" to the current column when the "
"return key is pressed in the Quickview panel. Otherwise the book is changed "
"but the column being examined is not. Default: change the column"
msgstr "Promeni kolonu koja se \"brzo pregleda\" u trenutnu kolonu kada se pritisne taster Enter u panelu Brzog prikaza. U suprotnom se knjiga menja, ali kolona koja se ispituje ne. Podrazumevano: promeni kolonu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:879
msgid "Choose which columns are shown in the Quickview window/panel."
msgstr "Izaberite koje kolone se prikazuju u prozoru/panelu Brzog prikaza."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:888
msgid "Jobs"
msgstr "Poslovi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:892
msgid ""
"The Jobs panel shows the number of currently running jobs. Jobs are tasks "
"that run in a separate process. They include converting e-books and talking "
"to your reader device. You can click on the jobs panel to access the list of"
" jobs. Once a job has completed you can see a detailed log from that job by "
"double-clicking it in the list. This is useful to debug jobs that may not "
"have completed successfully."
msgstr "Panel poslova prikazuje broj trenutno pokrenutih poslova. Poslovi su zadaci koji se izvršavaju u zasebnom procesu. Oni uključuju konvertovanje e-knjiga i komunikaciju sa vašim uređajem za čitanje. Možete kliknuti na panel poslova da biste pristupili listi poslova. Kada se posao završi, možete videti detaljan dnevnik tog posla dvostrukim klikom na njega u listi. Ovo je korisno za otklanjanje grešaka u poslovima koji se možda nisu uspešno završili."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:899
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Prečice na tastaturi"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:901
msgid ""
"calibre has several keyboard shortcuts to save you time and mouse movement. "
"These shortcuts are active in the book list view (when you're not editing "
"the details of a particular book), and most of them affect the title you "
"have selected. The calibre E-book viewer :ref:`has its own shortcuts "
"<viewer_shortcuts>` which can be customised in the viewer "
":guilabel:`Preferences`."
msgstr "calibre ima nekoliko prečica na tastaturi koje vam štede vreme i pokrete mišem. Ove prečice su aktivne u prikazu liste knjiga (kada ne uređujete detalje određene knjige), i većina njih utiče na naslov koji ste izabrali. calibre E-book viewer :ref:`ima svoje prečice <viewer_shortcuts>` koje se mogu prilagoditi u :guilabel:`Podešavanja` pregledača."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/gui.rst:905
msgid ""
"Note: The calibre keyboard shortcuts do not require a modifier key (Command,"
" Option, Control, etc.), unless specifically noted. You only need to press "
"the letter key, e.g. E to edit."
msgstr "Napomena: calibre prečice na tastaturi ne zahtevaju modifikatorski taster (Command, Option, Control, itd.), osim ako nije posebno naznačeno. Potrebno je samo da pritisnete taster sa slovom, npr. E za uređivanje."

